hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
3724,"Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ye dua kartey they : « اللهم إني أسألك الهدى والتقى والعفاف والغنى » '' aey Allah ! main tujh sey hidayat ka Talib hun, taqwa ka talabgar hun, pakdamni ka khaahishmand hun, maldari aur be niazi chahta hun ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
3725,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' Dawud (Alaihissalam) ki duaon mein sey eik dua ye thi : (اللهم إني أسألك حبك وحب من يحبك والعمل الذي يبلغني حبك اللهم اجعل حبك أحب إلي من نفسي وأهلي ومن الماء البارد)''aey Allah ! main tujh sey teri mohabbat maangta hun, aur main us shakhs ki bhi tujh sey mohabbat maangta hun jo tujh sey mohabbat karta hai, aur aisa amal chahta hun jo mujhey teri mohabbat tak pahuncha dey , aey Allah ! to apni mohabbat ko mujhey meri jaan aur merey ghar walon sey ziyada mehbub bana dey , aey Allah ! apni mohabbat ko thandey pani ki mohabbat sey bhi ziyada kar dey '' , ( Raavi ( kehtey hain : Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam jab Dawud (Alaihissalam) ka zikr kartey to unkey barey mein batatey huye kehtey : wo logon mein sab sey ziyada ibadat guzar they."
3726,"Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam apni dua mein kehtey they : (اللهم ارزقني حبك وحب من ينفعني حبه عندك اللهم ما رزقتني مما أحب فاجعله قوة لي فيما تحب اللهم وما زويت عني مما أحب فاجعله فراغا لي فيما تحب)'aey Allah ! to mujhey apni mohabbat ata kar , aur mujhey us shakhs ki bhi mohabbat ata kar jiski mohabbat mujhey terey darbar mein faeyda dey , aey Allah ! jo bhi to mujhey meri pasandida o pakizah rizq ata karey us rizq ko apni pasandida chizon mein istimal key liye quwat o taqat ka zaria bana dey ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
3727,"mein Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas aaya aur arz kya : Allah key Rasool ! mujhey koi aisa taaweez ( panah leney ki dua ( sikha dijiye jisey padh kar mein Allah ki panah hasil kar liya karun, to aap ney mera kandha pakda aur kaha : kaho ( padho ( : (اللهم إني أعوذ بك من شر سمعي ومن شر بصري ومن شر لساني ومن شر قلبي ومن شر منيي يعني فرجه)'' aey Allah ! main teri panah chahta hun apney kaan key shar sey , apni aankh key shar sey , apni zaban key shar sey , apney dil key shar sey , aur apni sharmgaah key shar sey '' ( mani sey murad sharmgaah hai) . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, aur hum is hadees ko sirf isi sanad yani « Saad bin Aus an Bilal bin Yahya» key tareeq sey jantey hain."
3728,"mein Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key pehlu mein soi hui thi, raat mainey aap ko apni jagah na paa kar aap ko idhar-udhar talash kya, tatola, mera haath aap key qadmon par pada , us waqt aap sajdey mein they, aur ye dua padh rahey they : (أعوذ برضاك من سخطك وبمعافاتك من عقوبتك لا أحصي ثناء عليك أنت كما أثنيت على نفسك) '' aey Allah ! main teri raza o khushnudi key zariey teri narazagi sey panah maangta hun, aur terey afu dar-guzar key saharey teri saza o azab sey panah maangta hun, main teri sana, teri tareef ki ginti aur uska Ihata nahin kar sakta, to wesa hi hai jaisa ke tu ney khud aap apni zaat ki tareef ki hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai aur ye hadees kaee sanadon sey Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) sey aai hai."
3729,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam unhen ( Sahaba ko) ye dua sikhaya kartey they jaisa ke unhen Quran ki sura sikhaya kartey they : (اللهم إني أعوذ بك من عذاب جهنم ومن عذاب القبر وأعوذ بك من فتنة المسيح الدجال وأعوذ بك من فتنة المحيا والممات) ''aey Allah ! main teri panah chahta hun jahannam key azab sey aur qabr key azab sey aur main teri panah chahta hun Masih dajjaal key fitna sey, aur main teri panah chahta hun hayaat o maut key fitney (kash-m-kash ( sey ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih gharib hai."
3730,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam un kalmaat key zariey dua farmaya kartey they : (اللهم إني أعوذ بك من فتنة النار وعذاب النار وفتنة القبر وعذاب القبر ومن شر فتنة الغنى ومن شر فتنة الفقر ومن شر فتنة المسيح الدجال اللهم اغسل خطاياي بماء الثلج والبرد وأنق قلبي من الخطايا كما أنقيت الثوب الأبيض من الدنس وباعد بيني وبين خطاياي كما باعدت بين المشرق والمغرب اللهم إني أعوذ بك من الكسل والهرم والمأثم والمغرم)''aey Allah ! main teri panah chahta hun jahannam key fitney sey , ( jahannam mein ley janey waley aamal sey) jahannam key azab sey aur qabr key azab sey , aur qabr key fitney sey, (munkar nakeer key sawal sey jiska jawab na padey) maldari key fitney key shar sey (takabbur aur haram kamai sey (aur mohtaji key fitney key shar sey, (hasad aur tamaa (lalach) sey) aur Masih dajjaal key shar sey, aey Allah ! hamarey gunahon ko dhul dey barf aur olon key pani sey, aur merey dil ko gunahon sey saaf kar dey jis tarah ke to safed kapda mail kuchail sey saaf karta hai, aur merey aur merey gunahon key darmiyan itni doori paida kar dey jitni doori tu ney mashriq aur maghrib key darmiyan paida kar di hai, aey Allah ! main teri panah chahta hun kaahili sey, budhapey sey, gunah sey aur tawaan o qarz key bojh sey''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
3731,mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko aap ki wafat key waqt ( ye dua ( padhtey huye suna hai : « اللهم اغفر لي وارحمني وألحقني بالرفيق الأعلى » '' aey Allah ! bakhsh dey mujh ko aur reham farma mujh par aur mujh ko rafeeqe-Aala (anbiya o malaaika) sey mila dey''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai.
3732,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' (koi shakhs dua maangey to) is tarah na kahey : '' aey Allah ! to chahey to hamen bakhsh dey , aey Allah ! to chahey to hum par reham farma '' padhi. balke zor daar tareeqey sey maangey , isliye ke Allah ko koi majbur karney wala to hai nahin (ke kaha jaey : agar to chahey ( , Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
3733,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' hamara rab har raat aasmane-duniya par aakhiri tihai raat mein utarta hai aur kehta hai : ''kon hai jo mujhey pukarey ke main uski dua qubul kar lun? kon hai jo mujh sey maangey ke main usey ata kar dun? aur kon hai jo mujh sey maghfirat maangey ke main usey bakhsh dun ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai 2- aur abu-Adbullah al-Agharr ka naam Salman hai, padhi. 3- is bab mein Ali , Abdullah bin Masood, abu-Saeed , Juber bin Mut-im , Rifa Johni, abu-Darda aur Usman bin abul-Aas (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi riwayatein hain."
3734,"puchha gaya : aey Allah key Rasool ! kon si dua ziyada suni jati hai? aap ney farmaya : ''aadhi raat key aakhir ki dua ( yani tihai raat mein maangi hui dua (aur farz namazon key akheer mein '' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai, 2- Abu-Zar aur ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat kartey hain ke aap ney farmaya : ''raat key aakhiri hissey mein dua sab sey behtar hai, ya uskey qubul honey ki umeeden ziyada hain ya usi jaisi koi aur baat aap ney farmaey''."
3735,"eik shakhs ney arz kya : Allah key Rasool ! mainey aaj raat aap ki dua suni , mainey aap ki jo dua suni wo ye thi : (اللهم اغفر لي ذنبي ووسع لي في داري وبارك لي فيما رزقتني) '' aey Allah ! merey gunah bakhsh dey aur merey ghar mein kushadgi dey , aur merey rizq mein barkat dey'' , aap ney farmaya : '' kya un dua'aiya kalmaat ney kuch chhoda? (yani un mein Deen duniya ki sabhi bhalaiyan aa gaee hain). Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees gharib hai."
3736,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jo shakhs subh mein ye kalmaat kaheyga : (اللهم أصبحنا نشهدك ونشهد حملة عرشك وملائكتك وجميع خلقك بأنك الله لا إله إلا أنت الله وحدك لا شريك لك وأن محمدا عبدك ورسولك) ''aey Allah! hamney subh ki aur hum tujhey gawah banatey hain aur tera arsh uthaey rehney walon , terey farishton ko teri sari makhluqat ko gawah bana kar kehtey hain ke tu hi Allah hai terey siwa koi mabood bar-haq nahin hai, to akela Allah hai tera koi shareek nahin hai, aur Muhammad Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam terey bandey aur terey Rasool hain'', to us din us sey jitney bhi gunah hongey unhen Allah bakhsh dega aur agar wo ye dua Sham key waqt padheyga to us raat us sey jitney bhi gunah sarzad hongey Allah unhen bakhsh dega . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees gharib hai."
3737,"kam hi aisa hota ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam apni kisi majlis sey apney Sahaba key liye ye dua kiye baghair uthey hun : (اللهم اقسم لنا من خشيتك ما يحول بيننا وبين معاصيك ومن طاعتك ما تبلغنا به جنتك ومن اليقين ما تهون به علينا مصيبات الدنيا ومتعنا بأسماعنا وأبصارنا وقوتنا ما أحييتنا واجعله الوارث منا واجعل ثأرنا على من ظلمنا وانصرنا على من عادانا wala تجعل مصيبتنا في ديننا wala تجعل الدنيا أكبر همنا wala مبلغ علمنا wala تسلط علينا من لا يرحمنا)''aey Allah! hamarey darmiyan to apna itna khof baant dey jo hamarey aur hamarey gunahon key darmiyan haael ho jaey, aur hamarey darmiyan apni itaat o farmanbradri ka itna jazba phela dey jo hamen teri jannat tak pahuncha dey, aur hamen itna yaqin dedey jis key saharey duniya ki museebatein heech aur aasan ho jaeyn, aur jab tak to zinda rakh hamen apney kanon apni aakhon aur apni quwaton sey faeyda uthaney ki tofiq deta reh, aur un sab ko (hamari maut tak) baqi rakh, aur hamara qisaas aur hamara badla un sey ley jo hum par zulm karey , aur jo hum sey dushmani karey uskey muqabil mein hamari madad farma , aur duniya ko hamara bura maqsad na bana dey , aur na hamarey ilm ki inteha bana (ke hamara sara seekhna sikhana sirf duniya ki khatir ho (aur hum par kisi aisey shakhs ko musallat na kar jo hum par reham na karey ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, baaz muhaddeseen ney ye hadees Khalid bin abu-Imraan sey aur Khalid ney Nafey key wastey sey ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma sey riwayat ki hai."
3738,"merey baap ney mujhey : (لا إله إلا الله العلي العظيم لا إله إلا الله الحليم الكريم لا إله إلا الله سبحان الله رب العرش العظيم) '' aey Allah main gham o fikr aur susti o kahili aur azabe-qabr sey teri panah chahta hun '' , padhtey huye suna to kaha : aey betey tu ney ye dua kis sey suni ? mainey kaha : mainey aap ko ye dua padhtey huye suni hai, unhoney kaha : unhen pabandi sey padhtey raha karo, isliye ke mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko ye dua padhtey huye suna hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
3739,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney mujh sey farmaya : '' kya main tum ko aisey kalmaat na sikha dun ke un kalmaat ko jab tum kaho gey to tumharey gunah Allah Taala maaf farma dega , agar-che tum un logon mein sey ho jinkey gunah pehley hi maaf kiye ja chukey hain'' , aap ney farmaya : '' kaho :(لا إله إلا الله العلي العظيم لا إله إلا الله الحليم الكريم لا إله إلا الله سبحان الله رب العرش العظيم)  '' Allah jo buland o baala hai, uskey siwa koi mabood bar-haq nahin hai, haleem o karim (burdbar (samajhdar) meharban ( Allah key siwa koi mabood nahin, koi mabood nahin siwaye Allah key , pak hai Allah jo arsh azeem ka rab hai ''."
3740,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' zun-noon( Yunus (Alaihissalam) ( ki dua jo unhoney machli key pet mein rehney key doran ki thi wo ye thi : (لا إله إلا أنت سبحانك إني كنت من الظالمين)  '' terey siwa koi mabood bar-haq nahin, Tu Pak hai, main hi zalim ( khatakar ( hun '' , kyonkey ye aisi dua hai ke jab bhi koi musalman shakhs usey padh kar dua kerega to Allah Taala uski dua qubul farmaeyga ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Muhammad bin Yahya ney kaha : Muhammad bin Yusuf kabhi Ibrahim bin Muhammad bin Saad key wastey sey Saad sey riwayat kartey hain aur is mein « an Abeeh » ka zikr nahin kartey , 2- doosrey raawiyon ney ye hadees Yunus bin Abu-Is-haq sey , aur Yunus ney Ibrahim bin Muhammad bin Saad key wastey sey Saad sey riwayat ki hai, aur us riwayat mein unhoney « an Abeeh » ka zikr nahin kya hai, padhi. - baaz ney Yunus bin Abu-Is'haq sey riwayat ki hai, aur un logon ney ibn Yusuf ki riwayat ki tarah Ibrahim bin Muhammad bin Saad sey riwayat kartey huye « an Abeeh an Saad » kaha hai aur Yunus bin Abu-Is'haq ki aadat thi ke kabhi to wo is hadees mein « an Abeeh » keh kar riwayat kartey aur kabhi « an Abeeh » ka zikr nahin kartey they."
3741,"Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' Allah Taala key ninnanwey padhi. naam hain, so main eik kam , jo unhen yad rakhey wo jannat mein dakhil hoga '' padhi. ."
3742,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' Allah Taala key ninnanwey ( 99 ( naam hain jo unhen shumar karey ( giney ( ga wo jannat mein jaeyga, aur Allah key ninnanwey ( 99 ( naam ye hain : « الله » Ism zaat sab namon sey ashraf o aalaa , « الرحمن » '' bahut reham karney wala '' , « الرحيم » '' meharban '' , « الملك » '' badshah '' , « القدوس » '' nihayat pak '' , « السلام » '' salamti deney wala '' , « المؤمن » '' yaqin wala '' , « المهيمن » '' nigehban '' , « العزيز » '' ghalib '' , « الجبار » '' tasallut wala '' , « المتكبر » '' badai wala '' , « الخالق » '' paida karney wala '' , « البارئ » '' paida karney wala '' , « المصور » '' surat bananey wala '' , « الغفار » '' bahut bakhshney wala , « القهار » '' qehar wala '' , « الوهاب » '' bahut deney wala '' , « الرزاق » '' rozi deney wala '' , « الفتاح » '' faisla chukaney wala '' , « العليم » '' janney wala '' , « القابض » '' rokney wala '' , « الباسط » '' chhod deney wala , phelaney wala '' , « الخافض » '' past karney wala '' , « الرافع » '' buland karney wala '' , « المعز » '' izzat deney wala '' , « المذل » '' zillat deney wala '' , « السميع » '' sunney wala '' , « البصير » '' dekhney wala '' , « الحكم » '' faisla karney wala '' , « العدل » '' insaf wala '' , « اللطيف » '' bandon par shafqat karney wala '' , « الخبير » '' khabar rakhney wala '' , « الحليم » '' burdbar (samajhdar) '' , « العظيم » '' buzurgi wala '' , « الغفور » '' bahut bakhshney wala '' , « الشكور » '' qadr karney wala '' , « العلي » '' ooncha '' , « الكبير » '' bada '' , « الحفيظ » '' nigehban '' , « المقيت » '' taqat o quwat wala '' , « الحسيب » '' hisab leney wala '' , « الجليل » '' buzurg '' , « الكريم » '' karam wala '' , « الرقيب » '' muttala rehney wala '' , « المجيب » '' qubul karney wala '' , « الواسع » '' kushadgi aur wusat wala '' , « الحكيم » '' hikmat wala '' , « الودود » '' bahut chahney wala '' , « المجيد » '' buzurgi wala '' , « الباعث » '' zinda kar key uthaney wala '' , « الشهيد » '' nigran , hazir '' , « الحق » '' sacha '' , « الوكيل » '' karsaz '' , « القوي » '' taqatwar '' , « المتين » '' mazbut '' , « الولي » '' madadgar o muhafiz '' , « الحميد » , padhi. « المحصي » , padhi. « المبدئ » '' pehley pehal paida karney wala '' , « المعيد » '' dobara paida karney wala '' , « المحيي » '' zinda karney wala '' , « المميت » '' maarney wala '' , « الحي » '' zinda '' , « القيوم » '' qaaim rehney o qaaim rakhney wala '' , « الواجد » '' paney wala '' , « الماجد » '' buzurgi wala '' , « الواحد » '' akela '' , « الصمد » '' be niaz '' , « القادر » '' qudrat wala '' , « المقتدر » '' taqatwar pakadney wala '' , « المقدم » '' pehla '' , « المؤخر » '' pichhlaa '' , « الأول » '' pehla '' , « الآخر » '' pichhlaa '' , « الظاهر » '' zahir '' , « الباطن » '' poshida , makhfii '' , « الوالي » '' Malik mukhtaar , hukumat karney wala '' , « المتعالي » '' bartar '' , « البر » '' bhalai wala '' , « التواب » '' tauba qubul karney wala '' , « المنتقم » '' intiqam leney wala '' , « العفو » '' darguzar karney wala '' , « الرءوف » '' shafqat wala , meharban '' , « maalik الملك » '' tamam jahan ka Malik '' , « ذو الجلال والإكرام » '' izzat o jalal wala '' , « المقسط » '' insaf karney wala '' , « الجامع » '' jama karney wala '' , « الغني » ''tawangar o beniyaz '' , « المغني » '' be niyaz '' , « المانع » '' rokney wala '' , « الضار » '' nuqsan pahunchane-wala '' , « النافع » '' nafa pahunchane-wala '' , « النور » '' roshan , zahir '' , « الهادي » '' hidayat bakhshney wala '' , « البديع » '' naey sirey sey paida karney wala '' , « الباقي » '' qaaim rehney wala '' , « الوارث » '' waris '' , « الرشيد » '' khair o bhalai wala '' , «"
3743,"Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' Allah Taala key ninnanwey ( 99 ( naam hain jisney unhen shumar kya ( yad rakha ( wo jannat mein jaeyga ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- is hadees mein Asma ( Ilahi (ka zikr nahin hai, 3- usey Abul-Yaman ney Shuaib bin abi Hamza key wastey sey abu-Zinad sey riwayat kya hai aur is mein Asmaye Husna ka zikr nahin kya."
3744,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jab tum jannat key baaghon mein sey kisi baagh key paas sey guzro to kuch char-chug liya karo'', main puchha : Allah key Rasool ! « رياض الجنة » kya hai? aap ney farmaya : '' « رياض الجنة » masaajid hain'' , mainey kaha aur « الرتع » kya hai, aey Allah key Rasool ! aap ney farmaya : '' سبحان الله والحمد لله wala إله إلا الله والله أكبر kehna «"
3745,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jab tum jannat key baaghon sey guzro to tum ( kuch ( char , chug liya karo padhi. logon ney puchha « رياض الجنة » kya hai? aap ney farmaya : '' zikr key halqey aur zikr ki majlisen ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees is sanad sey jisey Sabit ney Anas sey riwayat ki hai Hasan gharib hai."
3746,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jab tum mein sey kisi ko koi musibat laahiq ho to usey : إنا لله وإنا إليه راجعون اللهم عندك احتسبت مصيبتي فأجرني فيها وأبدلني منها خيرا'' hum sab Allah key liye hain aur hum Allah hi ki taraf lot kar janey waley hain, aey Allah ! main apni musibaton ka ajr tujh sey chahta hun mujhey to un par) sabr karney ka ( achcha ajr dey , aur un musibaton key badley mujhey un sey achcha dey '' , padhna chahiye, phir jab abu-Salma (Raziallahu anhu) ki maut ka waqt aa gaya to unhoney dua ki : « اللهم اخلف في أهلي خيرا مني » '' aey Allah ! merey ghar walon mein mujh sey behtar zaat ko mera khalifa o jaa-nashin bana dey'', aur jab unki maut waqey ho gaee to Umme-Salma (Raziallahu Anha) ney kaha : إنا لله وإنا إليه راجعون عند الله احتسبت مصيبتي فأجرني"
3747,"eik shakhs ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas aa kar arz kya : Allah key Rasool ! kon si dua afzal ( sab sey achi ( hai? aap ney farmaya : '' apney rab sey duniya o aakhirat mein balaaon o musibaton sey bacha deney ki dua karo '' , phir aap key paas wohi shakhs doosrey din bhi aaya , aur aap sey phir puchha : '' kon si dua afzal hai? '' aap ney isey wesa hi jawab diya jaisa pehley jawab diya tha, wo shakhs teesrey din bhi aap key paas hazir huwa , us din bhi aap ney usey wesa hi jawab diya, mazeed farmaya : '' jab tumhen duniya o aakhirat mein aafiyat mil jaey to samajh lo ke tum ney kamiyabi hasil kar li''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan gharib hai, hum isey sirf Salma bin Wardan ki riwayat sey jantey hain."
3748,"mainey kaha : Allah key Rasool ! agar mujhey malum ho jaey ke kon si raat Leilatul-Qadr hai to main is mein kya padhun? aap ney farmaya : ''padho « اللهم إنك afu كريم تحب العفو فاعف عني » '' aey Allah ! to afu o darguzar karney wala meharban hai, aur afu o darguzar karney ko to pasand karta hai, isliye to hamen maaf o darguzar kar dey''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
3749,"mainey kaha : Allah key Rasool ! mujhey koi aisi chiz sikhaaiye jisey main Allah rabbul-Izzat sey maangta rahun, aap ney farmaya : ''Allah sey aafiyat maango'', phir kuch din ruk kar main Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas hazir huwa aur arz kya : mujhey koi aisi chiz bataiye jisey main Allah sey maangta rahun, aap ney farmaya : ''aey Abbas ! aey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key chacha ! duniya o aakhirat mein aafiyat talab karo ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees sahih hai, 2- Abdullah bin Haris bin naufal ney Abbas bin abdul-Muttalib (Raziallahu anhu) sey suna hai (yani unka un sey samaa, Sabit hai) ."
3750,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' Allah sey jo bhi cheezen maangi gaee hain un mein Allah ko sab sey ziyada pasand ye hai ke us sey aafiyat ( duniya o aakhirat ki musibaton sey najat ( maangi jaey ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, 2- aur hum isey sirf Abdur-Rehman bin abu-Bakar Muleki ki riwayat sey jantey hain, (aur ye zaeef hain ( ."
3751,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam jab kisi kaam ka irada kartey to ye dua farmatey : « اللهم خر لي واختر لي » '' aey Allah ! merey liye behtar ka intikhaab farma aur merey liye behtar pasand farma ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai 2- aur hum usey Zanfal ki riwayat key siwa aur kisi sanad sey nahin jantey , aur ye muhaddeseen key nazdik zaeef hain, aur unhen Zanfal bin Abdullah Urfi bhi kehtey hain, wo Arafat mein rehtey they, wo is hadees mein munfarid hain, yani ye riwayat sirf unhoney hi bayan ki hai) kisi aur ney nahin (aur kisi ney bhi un ki mutaabiat nahin ki hai."
3752,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''wuzu aadha eman hai, aur « الحمد لله » ( Allah ki hamd ( meezaan ko sawab sey bhar dega aur « Subhanallah » aur « الحمد لله » ye dono bhar dengey aasmano aur zamin key darmiyan ki jagah ko ya un mein sey har eik bhar dega aasmano aur zamin key darmiyan ki sari khala ko) ajr o sawab sey) « صلاة » Noor hai, aur « صدقة » daleel aur kasoti hai) eman ki (aur « sabr » roshni hai aur « Quran » tumharey haq mein hujjat o daleel hai ya aur tumharey khilaf hujjat hai. har insan subh uth kar apney nafs ko farokht karta hai chunanche ya to ( Allah key yahan farokht kar key (us ko) jahannam sey) azad kara leta hai, ya (shetan key yahan farokht kar key (us ko halakat mein dal deta hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
3753,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' « تسبيح » ( subhan Allah kehney sey) nisf meezaan ( aadha paldaa ( bhar jaeyga, aur « الحمد لله » meezaan ( paldey key baqi khaali hissey ( ko pura bhar dega , aur « لا إله إلا الله » key to Allah tak pahunchney mein koi hijaab o rukawat hai hi nahin ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees is sanad sey gharib hai aur iski sanad qawi nahin hai."
3754,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney merey haath ki ungliyon ya apney haath ki ungliyon par gin kar bataya ke « Subhanallah » nisf meezaan rahega aur « الحمد لله » us purey paldey ko bhar dega aur « الله أكبر » aasman o zamin key darmiyan ki sari jagahon ko bhar dega , roza aadha sabr hai, aur paki nisf eman hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan hai aur is hadees ko Shoba aur Sufiyan Sory ney Abu-Is'haq sey riwayat kya hai."
3755,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam wuqoof Arfa key doran Arfa ki Sham aksar jo dua manga kartey they wo ye thi : اللهم لك الحمد كالذي نقول وخيرا مما نقول اللهم لك صلاتي ونسكي ومحياي ومماتي وإليك مآبي ولك رب تراثي اللهم إني أعوذ بك من عذاب القبر ووسوسة الصدر وشتات الأمر اللهم إني أعوذ بك من شر ما تجيء به الريح'' aey Allah ! terey liye hi hain sab taarifein jaisi ke tu ney hamen batai hain aur us sey behtar jaisi ke hum teri tareef kar saktey hain, aey Allah ! terey liye hi hai meri salaat , meri qurbani , meri zindagi aur meri maut , aur teri hi taraf hamen palat kar jana hai, aey merey rab ! terey liye hi hai meri meeras , aey Allah main azabe-qabr sey , seeney key waswasey sey aur mutafarriq o paraaganda kaam sey teri panah chahta hun aur aey Allah main teri panah chahta hun har us shar sey jisey hawa ley kar aati hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees is sanad sey gharib hai, iski sanad ziyada qawi nahin hai."
3756,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney bahut sari duaeyn kin, magar mujhey un mein sey koi dua yad na rahi , mainey arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! duaeyn to aap ney bahut si kin magar main koi dua yad na rakh saka , aap ney farmaya : ''kya main tumhen aisi chiz na bata dun jo un sab chizon (duaaon) ki Jaamey ho, kaho : (اللهم إنا نسألك من خير ما سألك منه نبيك محمد صلى الله عليه وسلم ونعوذ بك من شر ما استعاذ منه نبيك محمد صلى الله عليه وسلم وأنت المستعان وعليك البلاغ wala حول wala قوة إلا بالله) ''aey Allah ! hum tujh sey wo bhalai (khair) maangtey hain jo tujh sey terey Nabi Muhammad Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney maangi hai aur hum teri panah chahtey hain us shar (burai) sey jis sey terey Nabi Muhammad Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney panah maangi hai, tu hi madadgar hai, aur terey hi ikhtiyar mein hai (khair aur shar ka ( pahchaan'naa, aur gunah sey bachney ki taqat aur ibadat karney ki quwat Allah key saharey key baghair mumkin nahin hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
3757,"mainey Umme-Salma (Raziallahu Anha) sey puchha : Ummul-momenin ! jab Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ka qiyam aap key yahan hota to aap ki ziyada tar dua kya hoti thi? unhoney kaha : aap ziyada tar : (يا مقلب القلوب ثبت قلبي على دينك) ''aey dilon key pherney waley ! merey dil ko apney Deen par jama dey.'' padhtey they, khud mainey bhi aap sey puchha : aey Allah key Rasool ! aap aksar ye dua : (يا مقلب القلوب ثبت قلبي على دينك) kyon padhtey hain? aap ney farmaya : ''aey Umme-Salma ! koi bhi shakhs aisa nahin hai jis ka dil Allah ki ungliyon mein sey uski do ungliyon key darmiyan na ho, to Allah jisey chahta hai (deene-haq par) qaaim aur sabit qadam rakhta hai aur jisey chahta hai uska dil tedha kar deta hai phir (Raavi hadees) Muaz ney aayat : (ربنا لا تزغ قلوبنا بعد إذ"
3758,"Khalid bin Waleed Makhzoomi (Raziallahu anhu) ney Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey shikayat kartey huye kaha : Allah key Rasool ! main raat bhar neend na aaney ki wajeh sey so nahin paata hun, Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jab tum apney bistarey par soney key liye jaao to padho : (اللهم رب السموات السبع وما أظلت ورب الأرضين وما أقلت ورب الشياطين وما أضلت كن لي جارا من شر خلقك كلهم جميعا أن يفرط علي أحد منهم أو أن يبغي عز جارك وجل ثناؤك wala إله غيرك لا إله إلا أنت) ''aey Allah ! saton aasmano , aur jin par wo saya figan hain un sab key Rab ! sari zaminon aur un sari chizon key Rab jinka wo bojh uthaey huye hain aur aey shayatin aur jinhen unhoney gumrah kiya hai un sab key Rab ! apni sari makhluq key shar sey bachaney key liye mera padosi bin ja, taake un mein sey koi mujh par na zulm aur ziyadti kar sakey, aur na hi baghawat aur sarkashi ka murtakib (mujrim) ho, tera padosi ba-izzat ho, aur teri sanaa (aur tareef ( badh chadh kar ho, terey siwa koi mabood bar-haq nahin mabood to bas tu hi hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is hadees ki sanad qawi nahin hai. 2- Hakam bin Zuher jo is hadees key eik Raavi hain, baaz muhaddeseen un ki bayan karda hadees nahin letey. 3- ye hadees Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey eik dusri sanad sey mursal tareeqe sey aai hai."
3759,Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko jab koi kaam sakht takleef aur pareshani mein dal deta to aap ye dua padhtey : (يا حي يا قيوم برحمتك أستغيث) ''aey zinda aur hamesha rehney waley ! teri rehmat key waseeley sey teri madad chahta hun.''
3760,"Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : « يا ذا الجلال والإكرام » ko lazim pakdo (yani : apni duaaon mein barabar padhtey raha karo.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, mehfooz nahin hai. 2- ye hadees Hammad bin Salma ney Humaid sey, unhoney Hasan Basri key wastey sey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey (mursalan) riwayat ki hai, aur ye ziyada sahih hai. aur Muammal sey is mein ghalati hui hai, chunanche unhoney « an Humaid an Anas » diya, jabkey is mein unka koi mutaabe nahin hai."
3761,"mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey huye suna : ''jo shakhs apney bistar par pak aur saaf ho kar soney key liye jaey aur Allah ka zikr kartey huye usey neend aa jaey to raat key jis kisi lamhey mein bhi bedaar ho kar wo duniya aur aakhirat ki jo koi bhi bhalai , Allah sey maangeyga Allah usey wo chiz zarur ata karega.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- ye hadees Shehar bin Hoshab sey ba-tareeq : (أبي ظبية an عمرو بن عبسة an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم) marvi (riwayat hui) hai."
3762,"Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney eik shakhs ko dua maangtey huye suna wo keh raha tha : (اللهم إني أسألك تمام النعمة) ''aey Allah ! main tujh sey nemat تامہ mang raha hun''  aap ney us shakhs sey puchha : ''nemat تامہ kya chiz hai?'' us shakhs ney kaha : mainey eik dua maangi hai aur mujhey ummid hai ke mujhey us sey khair hasil hogi , aap ney farmaya : ''beshak nemat تامہ mein jannat ka daakhila aur jahannam sey najat dono aatey hain.'' aap ney eik aur aadmi ko (bhi) dua maangtey huye suna, wo keh raha tha : ''« يا ذا الجلال والإكرام »''  aap ney farmaya : ''teri dua qubul hui to mang ley (jo tujhey maangna ho)'' ,aap ney eik shakhs ko suna wo keh raha tha, « اللهم إني أسألك"
3763,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jab tum mein sey koi neend mein dar jaey to (ye dua) padhey : (أعوذ بكلمات الله التامات من غضبه وعقابه وشر عباده ومن همزات الشياطين وأن يحضرون) ''main panah maangta hun Allah key kamil aur jaame kalimon key zariey Allah key ghazab , Allah key azab aur Allah key bandon key shar aur fasad aur shayatin key waswason sey aur is baat sey ke wo hamarey paas aayen.'' (ye dua padhney sey) ye pareshan kun khuwab usey kuchh nuqsan na pahuncha sakeyga. (taake wo usey yad kar lein, na ke taawez key taur par) Abdullah bin umr Raziallahu anhuma apney baligh bachon ko ye dua sikha detey they, aur jo bachchey nabaligh hotey they unkey liye ye dua kaghaz par likh kar unkey galey mein latka detey they. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
3764,"main Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas Raziallahu anhuma key paas aaya aur un sey kaha : aap ney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey jo hadisein sun rakhi hain un mein sey koi hadees hamein sunaaiye, to unhoney eik likha huwa waraq hamarey aagey badha diya, aur kaha : ye wo kaghaz hai jisey Rasoolullah ney hamein likh kar diya hai, jab mainey usey dekha to is mein likha huwa tha ke abu-Bakar Siddiq (Raziallahu anhu) ney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! mujhey koi aisi dua bata dijiye jisey main subah aur Sham mein padha karun, aap ney farmaya : ''Abu-Bakar ! (ye dua) padha karo : (اللهم فاطر السموات والأرض عالم الغيب والشهادة لا إله إلا أنت رب كل شيء ومليكه أعوذ بك من شر نفسي ومن شر الشيطان وشركه وأن أقترف على نفسي سوءا أو أجره إلى مسلم) ''aey Allah ! aasmano aur zaminon key paida karney waley , khuli hui aur poshida chizon key janney waley , koi mabood bar-haq nahin hai siwaye terey , to har chiz ka Rab (paalney wala) aur uska badshah hai, aey Allah ! main teri panah chahta hun apney nafs key shar sey, shetan key shar aur uskey jaal aur phandon sey aur main teri panah chahta hun is baat sey ke main apney aap key khilaf koi gunah kar bethun, ya us gunah mein kisi musalman ko mulawwis kar dun.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan gharib hai."
3765,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Allah sey badh kar koi ghairat mand nahin hai, isi liye Allah Taala ney behayai ki cheezen haram kar di hain chahey wo khuley taur par hon ya poshida taur par, aur koi bhi aisa nahin hai jisey Allah sey ziyada madah (tareef) pasand ho, isi liye Allah ney apni zaat ki tareef khud aap ki hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
3766,"unhoney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey arz kiya : aap mujhey koi aisi dua bata dijiye jisey main apni namaz mein manga karun padhi. , aap ney farmaya : ''kaho : (اللهم إني zulmat نفسي ظلما كثيرا wala يغفر الذنوب إلا أنت فاغفر لي مغفرة من عندك وارحمني إنك أنت الغفور الرحيم) ''aey Allah ! mainey apney aap par bada zulm kiya hai, jabke gunahon ko terey siwa koi aur bakhsh nahin sakta, isliye to mujhey apni inayat khas sey bakhsh dey, aur mujh par reham farma, tu hi bakhshney wala aur reham farmanewala hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih gharib hai, aur ye Les bin Saad ki riwayat hai."
3767,"Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas aaye, to un unhoney koi baat suni (jis ki unhoney aap ko khabar di) Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam member par chadh gaey, aur puchha : ''main kon hun?'' logon ney kaha : aap Allah key Rasool ! aap par Allah ki salamti nazil ho, aap ney farmaya : ''main Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Abdul-Muttalib hun, Allah ney makhluq ko paida kiya to mujhey sab sey behtar giroh mein paida kiya, phir us giroh mein bhi do giroh bana diye aur mujhey un dono girohon mein sey behtar giroh mein rakha, phir un mein mukhtalif qabiley bana diye, to mujhey sab sey behtar qabiley mein rakha, phir unhen gharon mein baant diya to mujhey achchhey nasab waley behtareen khandan aur ghar mein paida kiya.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan hai."
3768,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam eik aisey darkht key paas sey guzrey jiski pattiyan sookh gaee thin, aap ney is par apni chhadi maari to pattiyan jhad padin, aap ney farmaya : ''« الحمد لله وسبحان الله wala إله إلا الله والله أكبر » kehney sey bandey key gunah aisey hi jhad jatey hain jaisey us darkht ki pattiyan jhad gaeen.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai. 2- Aamash ka Anas sey samaa (sun'na), hum nahin jantey, haan ye baat zarur hai ke unhoney Anas ko dekha hai."
3769,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jisney maghrib key baad das baar kaha : (لا إله إلا الله وحده لا شريك له له الملك وله الحمد يحيي ويميت وهو على كل شيء قدير) Allah uski subah tak hifazat key liye musalleh farishtey bhejeyga jo uski shetan sey hifazat karengey aur uskey liye unkey iwaz das nekiyan likhi jaeyngi jo usey ajr aur sawab ka mustahiq banaeyngi aur uski mohlik buraiyan aur gunah mita dengi aur usey das musalman ghulam azad karney ka sawab milega.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai aur hum isey sirf Les bin Saad ki riwayat sey jantey hain. 2- aur hum Imaara ka Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey samaa (sun'na), nahin jantey."
3770,"main Safwan bin Assaal Muraadi (Raziallahu anhu) key paas mozon par masah ka masla poochhney aaya, unhoney (mujh sey) puchha aey Zar kon sa jazba tumhen ley kar yahan aaya hai, mainey kaha : ilm ki talash aur talab mujhey yahan ley kar aai hai, unhoney kaha : farishtey ilm ki talab aur talash sey khush ho kar Talibe ilm key liye apney par bichhate hain, mainey un sey kaha : peshab pakhaney sey faraaghat key baad mozon par masah ki baat merey dil mein khatki (ke masah karen ya na karen) main khud bhi Sahabiye Rasool hun, main aap sey ye poochhney aaya hun ke kya aap ney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko is silsiley mein koi baat bayan kartey huye suna hai? kaha : ji haan (suni hai) jab hum safar par hotey ya safar karney waley hotey to aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam hamein hukm detey they ke ''hum safar key doran teen din aur raat apney mozey na nikalen, magar ghusle-janabat key liye, pakhana peshab kar key aur so kar uthney par mozey na nikalen.''  (pehney rahen, masah ka waqt aaye un par masah kar lein) mainey un sey puchha : kya aap ney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey insan ki khahish aur tamanna ka zikr kartey huye suna hai? unhoney kaha : haan, hum Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key sath safar kar rahey they, us doran ke hum Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas they eik Erabi (dehati) (dehaati) ney aap ko ya Muhammad ! keh kar buland aawaz sey pukara , Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney isey usi ki aawaz mein jawab diya, ''aa jaao (main yahan hun)'' hamney us sey kaha : tumhara naas ho, apni aawaz dheemi kar lo, kyonkey tum Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas ho, aur tumhen is sey mana kiya gaya hai ke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas buland aawaz sey bola jaey, Erabi (dehati) ney kaha : (na) qism Allah ki main apni aawaz past nahin karunga, usney « المرء يحب القوم ولما يلحق بهم keh kar aap sey apni intehai mohabbat aur talluq ka izhar kiya. Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : (المرء مع من أحب يوم القيامة) ''jo shakhs jis shakhs sey ziyada mohabbat karta hai qiyamat key din wo isi key sath rahega.'' wo hum sey (yani Zar kehtey hain hum sey Safwan bin Assaal) hadees bayan kartey rahey yahan tak ke unhoney pashchim samt (maghrib ki taraf) main eik aisey darwazey ka zikr kiya jiski chodai sattar saal ki masafat (doori) key barabar hai (Raavi ko shak ho gaya hai ye kaha ya ye kaha) ke darwazey ki chodai itni hogi. sawar is mein chaleyga to chaalis saal ya sattar saal main eik sirey sey doosrey sirey tak pahunchega, Sufiyan (Raavi) kehtey hain : ye darwaza Sham ki janib padeyga, jab Allah ney aasmano aur zamin ko paida kiya hai tabhi Allah ney ye darwaza bhi banaya hai aur ye darwaza tauba karney walon key liye khula huwa hai aur (tauba ka ye darwaza) us waqt tak band na hoga jab tak ke suraj us darwaze ki taraf sey (yani pashchim sey) tulu na honey lagey. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
3771,"main Safwan bin Assaal Muraadi (Raziallahu anhu) key paas aaya, unhoney puchha : tumhen kya chiz yahan ley kar aai hai? mainey kaha : ilm hasil karney aaya hun, unhoney kaha : mujhey ye hadees pahunchi hai ke ''farishtey Talibe ilm key kaam (aur maqsad) sey khush ho kar Talibe ilm key liye apney par bichha detey hain.''  wo kehtey hain : mainey kaha : merey ji mein ye khayal guzra ya merey dil mein mozon par maseh key barey mein kuch baat khatki, to kya us barey mein aap ko Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki koi baat yad hai? unhoney kaha : ji haan , hum jab safar mein hon (ya safar karney waley hon) to hamein hukm diya gaya ke ''hum teen din tak apney mozey pairon sey na nikalen, siwaye janabat ki surat mein, pakhana kar key aaye hon ya peshab kar key, ya so kar uthey hon to mozey na nikalen.'' phir mainey un sey puchha : kya aap ko mohabbat aur chaahat key silsiley mein bhi Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki koi baat yad hai? unhoney kaha : haan, hum Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key sath kisi safar mein they to aap ko eik aadmi ney jo logon mein sab sey peechhey chal raha tha aur ganwaar, bewaquf aur sakht mizaj tha, buland aawaz sey pukara , kaha : ya Muhammad ! ya Muhammad ! logon ney us sey kaha : thehar , thehar , is tarah pukarney sey tumhen roka gaya hai, Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney isey usi ki tarah bhari aur buland aawaz mein jawab diya : ''badh aa, badh aa, aa ja aa ja.'' (wo jab qarib aa gaya) to bola : aadmi kuchh logon sey mohabbat karta hai lekin unkey darjey tak nahin pahuncha hota hai, to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo insan jis sey mohabbat karta hai isi key sath uthaya jaeyga.'' Zar kehtey hain : wo mujh sey hadees bayan kartey rahey yahan tak ke unhoney mujh sey bayan kiya ke ''Allah ney maghrib mein tauba ka eik darwaza banaya hai jiski chodai sattar saal ki masafat (doori) hai, wo band na kiya jaeyga yahan tak ke suraj udhar sey nikalney lagey (yani qiyamat tak) aur isi silsiley mein Allah Taala ka ye qol hai : (يوم يأتي بعض آيات ربك لا ينفع نفسا"
3772,Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Allah apney bandey ki tauba us waqt tak qubul karta hai jab tak ke (maut key waqt) uskey galey sey khar khar ki aawaz na aaney lagey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai.
3773,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Allah taala apney bandey ki tauba sey us sey kahin ziyada khush hota hai jitna ke koi shakhs apni khoi hui chiz (khaas taur sey gumshuda sawari ki oontni paa kar khush hota hai).'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan sahih gharib hai, yani abu-Zinad ki riwayat sey. 2- ye hadees Mak'hool sey bhi un ki apni sanad sey aai hai, unhoney Abu-Zar key wastey sey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey isi tarah ki hadees riwayat ki hai. 2- is bab mein ibne-Masood, Noman bin Bashir aur Anas (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
3774,"jab un ki maut ka waqt qarib aa gaya to unhoney kaha : mainey tum logon sey eik baat chhupa rakhi hai, (main usey is waqt zahir kar dena chahta hun) mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey huye suna hai : ''agar tum log gunah na karo to Allah eik aisi makhluq paida kar dey jo gunah karti phir Allah unhen bakhshta.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- ye hadees Muhammad bin Kaab sey aai hai aur unhoney isey abu-Ayyub key wastey sey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey isi tarah riwayat ki hai."
3775,"mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey huye suna : ''Allah kehta hai : aey Adam key betey ! jab tak to mujh sey duaaeyn karta rahega aur mujh sey apni umeeden aur tawaqqoaat wabasta rakheyga main tujhey bakhshta rahunga, chahey terey gunah kisi bhi darjey par pahunchey huye hon, mujhey kisi baat ki parwah aur dar nahin hai, aey Adam key betey ! agar terey gunah aasman ko chhuney lagen phir to mujh sey maghfirat talab karney lagey to main tujhey bakhsh dunga aur mujhey kisi baat ki parwah na hogi. aey Adam key betey ! agar to zamin barabar bhi gunah kar bethey aur phir mujh sey (maghfirat talab karney key liye) miley lekin merey sath kisi tarah ka shirk na kiya ho to main terey paas uskey barabar maghfirat ley kar aaunga (aur tujhey bakhsh dunga).''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai aur hum is hadees ko sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain."
3776,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Allah taala ney sau rahmatein paida kin aur eik rehmat apni makhluq key darmiyan duniya mein rakhi, jiski badolat wo duniya main eik doosrey key sath rehmat aur shafqat sey pesh aatey hain, jabke Allah key paas ninnanwey (99) rahmatein hain.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is bab mein Salman aur Jundub bin Abdullah bin Sufiyan Bijli (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi ahadees aai hain."
3777,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''agar momin ko malum ho jaey ke Allah key yahan kaisi kaisi sazaaeyn hain to jannat ki koi ummid na rakhey, aur agar kafir ye jaan ley ke Allah ki rehmat kitni wasee aur azeem hai to jannat mein pahunchney sey koi bhi na-umeed aur mayus na ho.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai. 2- hum isey sirf Abu Alaa ki riwayat sey jantey hain jisey wo apney walid aur unkey walid Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat kartey hain."
3778,Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jab Allah ney makhluq ko paida kiya to usney apney aap sey apni zaat par likh diya (yani apney aap par farz kar liya) ke meri rehmat merey ghazab (ghusse) par ghalib rahegi.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih gharib hai.
3779,"Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam masjid mein aaye , eik shakhs namaz padh raha tha aur dua maangtey huye wo apni dua mein keh raha tha : (اللهم لا إله إلا أنت المنان بديع السموات والأرض ذا الجلال والإكرام) ''aey Allah ! terey siwa koi aur mabood bar-haq nahin hai, tu hi ehsan karney wala hai tu hi aasmano aur zamin ka bananey aur paida karney wala hai, aey badai waley aur karam karney waley (meri dua qubul farma).''  Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''kya tum jantey ho usney kis chiz sey dua ki hai? usney Allah sey uskey us Isme-Azam (bade naam) key zariye dua ki hai ke jab bhi uskey zariye dua ki jaeygi Allah usey qubul kar ley ga, aur jab bhi uskey zariye koi chiz maangi jaeygi usey ata farma dega.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey gharib hai. 2- ye hadees is sanad key ilawa dusri sanad sey bhi Anas sey aai hai."
3780,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''us shakhs ki naak khaak aalud ho jis key paas mera zikr kiya jaey aur wo shakhs mujh par durood na bhejey, aur us shakhs ki bhi naak khaak aalud ho jiski zindagi mein Ramzan ka mahina aaya aur uski maghfirat huye baghair wo mahina guzar gaya, aur us shakhs ki bhi naak khaak aalud ho jisney apney maa baap ko budhapey mein paya ho aur wo dono usey unkey sath husne-suluk na karney ki wajeh sey jannat ka mustahiq na bana sakey hon.''  Abdur-Rehman ( Raavi ( kehtey hain : mera khayal ye hai ke aap ney dono maa baap kaha. ya ye kaha ke un mein sey kisi eik ko bhi budhapey mein paya (aur un ki khidmat kar key apni maghfirat na kar li ho). Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan gharib hai. 2- Rabaee bin Ibrahim Ismail bin Ibrahim key bhai hain aur ye Suqa (bharosemand) hain aur ye ibne Aleh padhi. hain. 3- is bab mein Jabir aur Anas Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi ahadees aai hain. 4- baaz ehle-ilm sey marvi (riwayat hui) hai, wo kehtey hain : jab majlis mein aadmi eik baar Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko durood bhej dey to us majlis mein chahey jitni baar aap ka naam aaye eik baar durood bhej dena har baar key liye kafi hoga (yani har baar durood bhejna zaruri na hoga)."
3781,Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''bakheel (kanjoos) wo hai jis key samney mera zikr kiya jaey aur phir bhi wo mujh par salaat (durood) na bhejey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih gharib hai.
3782,Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ye dua kartey they : (اللهم برد قلبي بالثلج والبرد والماء البارد اللهم نق قلبي من الخطايا كما نقيت الثوب الأبيض من الدنس) ''aey Allah ! to merey dil ko thanda kar dey barf aur oley sey aur thandey pani sey aur merey dil ko khtaaon sey paak aur saaf kar dey jaisa ke tu ney safed kapdey ko mail kuchail sey paak aur saaf kiya hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih gharib hai.
3783,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''tum mein sey jis kisi key liye dua ka darwaza khola gaya to uskey liye (goya) rehmat key darwazey khol diye gaey, aur Allah sey maangi janey wali chizon mein sey jisey wo dey us sey ziyada koi chiz pasand nahin ke us sey aafiyat maangi jaey.''"
3784,"Abdur-Rehman bin abu-Bakar sey riwayat ki hai aur Abdur-Rehman ney Musa bin Aqba sey , Musa ney Nafey sey , aur Nafey ney ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma key wastey sey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey , aap ney farmaya : ''Allah sey jo cheezen bhi maangi jati hain un mein Allah ko aafiyat sey ziyada mehbub koi chiz bhi nahin hai.''"
3785,Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''hamari ummat ki umrein saath aur sattar (saal) key darmiyan hain aur thodey hi log aisey hongey jo us had ko paar karengey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai yani Muhammad bin Amr ki riwayat sey jisey wo abi Salma sey aur abu-Salma Abu-Hurera key wastey sey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat kartey hain. 2- hum (abu-Salma ki) is hadees ko sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain. 3- ye hadees is sanad key ilawa dusri sanad sey bhi Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey aai hai.
3786,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam dua maangtey huye ye kehtey they : (رب أعني wala تعن علي وانصرني wala تنصر علي وامكر لي wala تمكر علي واهدني ويسر الهدى لي وانصرني على من بغى علي رب اجعلني لك شكارا لك ذكارا لك رهابا لك مطواعا لك مخبتا إليك أواها منيبا رب تقبل توبتي واغسل حوبتي وأجب دعوتي وثبت حجتي وسدد لساني واهد قلبي واسلل سخيمة صدري) ''aey merey Rab ! meri madad kar , merey khilaf kisi ki madad na kar , aey Allah ! to meri taeed aur nusrat farma aur merey khilaf kisi ki taeed aur nusrat na farma, aur merey liye tadbeer farma aur merey khilaf kisi key liye tadbeer na farma, aur aey Allah ! to mujhey hidayat bakhsh aur hidayat ko merey liye aasan farma, aur aey Allah ! meri madad farma us shakhs key muqabil mein jo merey khilaf baghawat aur sarkashi kerey. aey merey Rab ! to mujhey apna bahut ziyada shukar-guzar banda bana ley, apna bahut ziyada yad aur zikr karney wala bana ley, apney sey bahut darney wala bana dey, apni bahut ziyada itaat karney wala bana dey, aur apney samney aajizi karney wala bana dey, aur apney sey dard aur bayan karney aur apni taraf ruju karney wala bana dey. aey merey Rab ! meri tauba qubul farma aur merey gunah dho dey, aur meri dua qubul farma , aur meri hujjat (meri daleel) ko sabit aur thos bana dey, aur meri zaban ko theek baat kehney wali bana dey, merey dil ko hidayat farma, aur merey seeney sey khot keena hasad nikal dey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
3787,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jisney apney ooper zulm karney waley key khilaf bad dua ki to usney us sey badla ley liya.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai. 2- hum isey Hamza ki riwayat sey jantey hain aur Hamza key barey mein baaz ehle-ilm ney unkey hafizey key talluq sey kalam kiya hai, aur ye Memun hain."
3788,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jisney das baar : (لا إله إلا الله وحده لا شريك له له الملك وله الحمد يحيي ويميت وهو على كل شيء قدير) ''Allah wahid key siwa koi mabood nahin hai, uska koi shareek aur saajhi nahin usi key liye hai mulk (badshahat) usi key liye hai sari tareefen, wohi zindagi bakhshta hai aur wohi maarta hai aur wo har chiz par qadir hai.''  kaha to ye (uska ajr) aulade Ismail mein sey chaar ghulam azad karney key barabar hoga.''  ye hadees abu-Ayyub (Raziallahu anhu) sey moqufan bhi riwayat hui hai."
3789,"mainey Safiya Raziallahu anhuma ko kehtey huye suna : merey paas Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam tashrif laye, us waqt merey samney khajoor ki chaar hazar guthliyon ki dher thi, main un guthliyon key zariye tasbih padha karti thi, mainey kaha : mainey in key zariye tasbih padhi hai, aap ney farmaya : ''kya ye achchha na hoga ke main tumhen is sey ziyada tasbih ka tariqa bata dun jitni tu ney padhi hain?'' mainey kaha : (zarur) mujhey bataiye, to aap ney farmaya : (سبحان الله عدد خلقه) ''main teri makhluqat ki tadaad key barabar teri tasbih bayan karti hun''  padh liya karo. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai. 2- hum isey Safiya ki riwayat sey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain yani Haashim bin Saeed Koofi ki riwayat sey aur iski sanad maroof nahin hai. 3- is bab mein ibne-Abbas Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi riwayat hai."
3790,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam unkey paas sey guzrey aur wo (us waqt) apni masjid mein thin (jahan wo ba-qaeeda ghar mein namaz padhti thin), dophare mein Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ka unkey paas sey phir guzar huwa, Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney un sey puchha : tab sey tum isi haal mein ho? (yani usi waqt sey is waqt tak tum zikr aur tasbih hi mein bethi ho) unhoney kaha : ji haan , aap ney farmaya : ''kya main tumhen chand kalimey aisey na sikha dun jinhen tum keh liya karo. (aur phir pura sawab paao) wo kalimey ye hain : (سبحان الله عدد خلقه ، سبحان الله عدد خلقه ، سبحان الله عدد خلقه ، سبحان الله رضا نفسه ، سبحان الله رضا نفسه ، سبحان الله رضا نفسه ، سبحان الله زنة عرشه ، سبحان الله زنة عرشه ، سبحان الله زنة عرشه ، سبحان الله مداد كلماته ، سبحان الله مداد كلماته ، سبحان الله مداد"
3791,"Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Allah (حيي كريم) hai yani zinda aur mojud hai aur shareef hai usey is baat sey sharam aati hai ke jab koi aadmi uskey samney haath phela dey to wo uskey dono haathon ko khaali aur nakam aur na-murad wapis kar dey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, baaz dusron ney bhi ye hadees riwayat ki hai, lekin unhoney isey marfoo nahin kiya hai."
3792,eik shakhs apni do ungliyon key isharay sey dua karta tha to aap ney us sey kaha : ''eik sey eik sey.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih gharib hai. 2- yehi is hadees ka mafhoom ye hai ke aadmi tashahud mein ungliyon sey ishara kartey waqt sirf eik ungli sey ishara karey.
3793,"Abu-Bakar Siddiq (Raziallahu anhu) member par chadhey, aur roey , phir kaha : Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam hijrat key pehley saal member par chadhey , roey , phir kaha : Allah sey (gunahon sey) maafi aur musibaton aur gumrahiyon sey aafiyat talab karo kyonkey eman aur yaqin key baad kisi bandey ko aafiyat sey behtar koi chiz nahin di gaee. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees is sanad sey yani abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki sanad sey Hasan gharib hai."
3794,Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo shakhs gunah kar key tauba kar ley aur apney gunah par naadim ho to wo chahey din bhar mein sattar baar bhi gunah kar daley wo gunah par Misr aur bazid nahin maana jaeyga.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai. 2- hum isey sirf Abu Nusaira ki riwayat sey jantey hain. aur iski sanad ziyada qawi nahin hai.
3795,"umr bin Khattab ney naya kapda pehnaa phir ye dua padhi :« الحمد لله الذي كساني ما أواري به عورتي وأتجمل به في حياتي » ''tamam tareefen us Allah key liye hain jisney mujhey aisa kapda pehnaya jis sey main apni sattar poshi karta hun aur apni zindagi mein husn aur jamaal paida karta hun.''  phir unhoney kaha : mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko kehtey huye suna : ''jisney naya kapda pehnaa phir ye dua padhi :« الحمد لله الذي كساني ما أواري به عورتي وأتجمل به في حياتي » phir usney apna puraanaa (utaara huwa) kapda liya aur usey sadqe mein dey diya, to wo Allah ki hifazat aur panah mein rahega zindagi mein bhi aur marney key baad bhi.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees gharib hai."
3796,"Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney Najad ki taraf eik fauj bheji to usney bahut sari ghanimat hasil kiya aur jald hi lot aai, (jang mein) na janey walon mein sey eik ney kaha : mainey is fauj sey behtar koi fauj nahin dekhi jo is fauj sey ziyada jald lot aaney wali aur ziyada maale ghanimat ley kar aaney wali ho. Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''kya main tum logon ko eik aisey logon ki eik jamaat na bataaun jo ziyada ghanimat wali aur jald wapis aa janey wali ho? ye wo log hain jo namaze Fajr mein hazir hotey hain phir beth kar Allah ka zikr kartey hain yahan tak ke suraj nikal aata hai ye log (un sey) jald lot aaney waley aur (un sey) ziyada maale ghanimat laney waley hain.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, hum isey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain. 2- Hammad bin abi Humaid ye Muhammad bin Abi Humaid hain, aur ye Abu Ibrahim Ansari Madni hain. hadees bayan karney mein zaeef hain."
3797,"unhoney Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey Umra karney ki ijazat maangi to aap ney (ijazat detey huye) kaha : ''aey merey bhai ! apni dua mein hamein bhi shareek rakhna, bhoolna nahin.''Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
3798,"eik makatib ghulam (wo ghulam jisne apni azaadi ke liye koi muhaaida kar rakha ho) ney padhi. unkey paas aa kar kaha ke main apni makatibat ki raqam ada nahin kar paa raha hun, aap hamari kuchh madad farma dijiye to unhoney kaha : kya main tum ko kuchh aisey kalimey na sikha dun jinhen Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney hamein sikhaey they? agar terey paas (seer) pahad key barabar bhi qarz ho to teri janib sey Allah usey ada farma dega, unhoney kaha : kaho : (اللهم اكفني بحلالك an حرامك وأغنني بفضلك عمن سواك) ''aey Allah ! to hamein halal dey kar haram sey kifaayat kar dey, aur apney Fazal (rizq, maal aur dolat) sey nawaz kar apney siwa kisi aur sey maangney sey be-niyaz kar dey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
3799,"mujhey shikayat hui (bimari hui), Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam merey paas tashrif laye, us waqt main dua kar raha tha : (اللهم إن كان أجلي قد حضر فأرحني وإن كان متأخرا فارفغني وإن كان بلاء فصبرني) ''aey merey Rab ! agar meri maut ka waqt aa pahuncha hai to mujhey (maut dey kar) rahat dey aur aur agar meri maut baad mein ho to mujhey utha kar khada kar dey (yani sehat dedey) aur agar ye aazmaaish hai to mujhey sabr dey.''  Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney puchha : ''kaisey kaha'' to unhoney jo kaha tha usey dohraayaa, aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney unhen apney pair sey thokaa diya phir aap ney farmaya : (اللهم عافه أو"
3800,"jab Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam kisi bimar ki iyaadat kartey to ye dua padhtey they : (اللهم أذهب البأس رب الناس واشف فأنت الشافي لا شفاء إلا شفاؤك شفاء لا يغادر سقما) ''aey Allah ! aey logon key Rab ! azab aur takleef ko door kar dey aur shifaa dedey, tu hi shifaa deney wala hai, teri di hui shifaa key siwa koi shifaa nahin hai, aisi shifaa dey ke bimari kuchh bhi baqi na rahey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan hai."
3801,"Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam apni (namaz) witr mein ye dua padhtey they : (اللهم إني أعوذ برضاك من سخطك وأعوذ بمعافاتك من عقوبتك وأعوذ بك منك لا أحصي ثناء عليك أنت كما أثنيت على نفسك). Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Ali ki riwayat sey Hasan gharib hai, hum isey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain, yani Hammad ibne Salma ki riwayat sey. faeyda padhi. : ''aey Allah ! main teri narazagi sey bach kar teri raza aur khushnoodi ki panah mein aata hun, aey Allah ! main terey azab aur saza sey bach kar terey azab aur saza se bachkar teri maafi ki panah chahta hun, aey Allah ! main teri panah chahta hun terey ghazab sey , main teri sanaa (tareef) ka ihaata aur shumar nahin kar sakta to to wesa hi hai jaisa ke tu ney khud apney aap ki sanaa aur tareef ki hai.''"
3802,"Saad bin abi Waqas apney beton ko ye kalimey aisey hi sikhatey they jaise ke chhotey bachchon ko likhna padhna sikhaaney wala muallim sikhata hai aur kehtey they ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam in kalimaat key zariey har namaz key akheer mein Allah ki panah maangtey they. (wo kalimey ye they) : (اللهم إني أعوذ بك من الجبن وأعوذ بك من البخل وأعوذ بك من أرذل العمر وأعوذ بك من فتنة الدنيا وعذاب القبر) ''aey Allah ! main teri panah leta hun buzdili sey, aey Allah ! main teri panah leta hun kanjusi sey, aey Allah ! main teri panah leta hun zaleel tareen umr sey (yani us budhapey sey jis mein aql aur hawas kuchh na reh jaey) aur panah maangta hun duniya key fitne aur qabr key azab sey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan sahih hai. 2- Abdullah bin Abdur-Rehman Darmi kehtey hain : Abu-Is'haq Hamdaani is hadees mein iztirab ka shikar they, kabhi kehtey they : riwayat hai Amr bin Memun sey aur wo riwayat kartey hain umr sey, aur kabhi kisi aur sey kehtey aur us riwayat mein iztirab kartey they."
3803,"wo Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key sath eik aurat key paas gaey, uskey aagey khajoor ki guthliyaan thin ya kankariyaan, unkey zariey wo tasbih padha karti thi, aap ney us sey farmaya : ''kya main tumhen is sey aasan tariqa na bata dun? ya is sey afzal aur behtar tariqa na bata dun? (ke sawab mein bhi ziyada rahey aur lambi chodi ginti karney sey bhi bacha rahey) wo ye hai : (سبحان الله عدد ما خلق في السماء ، وسبحان الله عدد ما خلق في الأرض ، وسبحان الله عدد ما بين ذلك ، وسبحان الله عدد ما هو خالق ، والله أكبر مثل ذلك ، والحمد لله مثل ذلك ، wala حول wala قوة إلا بالله مثل ذلك) ''paaki hai Allah ki itni jitni usney aasman mein cheezen paida ki hain, aur paaki hai Allah ki itni jitni usney zamin mein cheezen paida ki hain, aur paaki hai uski itni jitni ke un dono key darmiyan cheezen hain, aur paaki hai uski itni jitni ke wo (aainda) paida karney wala hai, aur aisey hi Allah ki badai hai aur aisey hi Allah key liye hamd hai aur aisey hi لا حول wala"
3804,Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''koi subah aisi nahin hai ke Allah key bandey subah kartey hon aur us subah mein koi pukar kar kehney wala ye na kehta ho ke (سبحان الملك
3805,"us doran ke hum Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas they ke usi doran Ali (Raziallahu anhu) aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas aaye aur aa kar arz kya : merey maa baap aap par qurban , ye Quran to merey seeney sey nikalta ja raha hai, mein usey mehfooz nahin rakh paa raha hun, Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' abul-Hasan ! kya main tumhen aisey kalmey na sikha dun ke jinkey zariey Allah tumhen bhi faeyda dey aur unhen bhi faeyda pahunchey jinhen tum ye kalmey sikhao ? aur jo tum seekho wo tumharey seeney mein mehfooz rahey '' , unhoney kaha : ji haan , aey Allah key Rasool ! aap hamen zarur sikhaaiye , aap ney farmaya : '' jab Juma ki raat ho aur raat key aakhiri tihai hissey main tum khadey ho saktey ho to uth kar us waqt ibadat karo kyonkey raat key teesrey pahar ka waqt aisa waqt hota hai jis mein farishtey bhi mojud hotey hain, aur dua us waqt maqbool hoti hai, merey bhai Yaqub (Alaihissalam) ney bhi apney beton sey kaha tha : « سوف أستغفر لكم ربي » yani main tumharey liye apney rab sey maghfirat talab karunga , aaney wali Juma ki raat mein , agar na uth sako to darmiyan pahar mein uth jaao , aur agar darmiyani hissey ( pahar ( mein na uth sako to pehley pahar hi mein uth jaao aur chaar rakat namaz padho , pehli rakat mein Sura Fatiha aur Sura Yasin padho, dusri rakat mein Sura Fatiha aur Ha-Mim Dukhan aur teesri rakat mein Sura Fatiha aur Sura Sajda aur chauthii rakat mein Sura Fatiha aur Mulk( mufassal ( padho , phir jab tashahud sey farigh ho jaao to Allah ki hamd bayan karo aur achey dhang sey Allah ki sanaa bayan karo, aur mujh par salaat ( durood ( bhejo , aur achey dhang sey bhejo aur sarey nabiyon salaat par) durood ( bhejo aur momin mardon aur momina aurton key liye maghfirat talab karo, aur un momin bhaiyon key liye bhi maghfirat ki dua karo, jo tum sey pehley us duniya sey ja chukey hain, phir ye sab kar chikney key baad ye dua padho : اللهم ارحمني بترك المعاصي أبدا ما أبقيتني وارحمني أن أتكلف ما لا يعنيني وارزقني حسن النظر فيما يرضيك عني اللهم بديع السموات والأرض ذا الجلال والإكرام والعزة التي لا ترام أسألك يا ألله يا رحمن بجلالك ونور وجهك أن تلزم قلبي حفظ كتابك كما علمتني وارزقني أن أتلوه على النحو الذي يرضيك عني اللهم بديع السموات والأرض ذا الجلال والإكرام والعزة التي لا ترام أسألك يا ألله يا رحمن بجلالك ونور وجهك أن تنور بكتابك بصري وأن تطلق به لساني وأن تفرج به an قلبي وأن تشرح به صدري وأن تغسل به بدني فإنه لا يعينني على الحق غيرك wala يؤتيه إلا أنت wala حول wala قوة إلا بالله العلي العظيم'' aey Allah ! mujh par reham farma is tarah ke jab tak to mujhey zinda rakh main hamesha gunah chhodey rakhun , aey Allah ! to mujh par reham farma is tarah ke main la yani chizon mein na padoon , jo cheezen teri raza o khushnudi ki hain unhen pehchanney key liye mujhey husney-nazar ( achi nazar ( dey , aey Allah ! aasmano aur zaminon key paida karney waley , Zul-Jalal (rob-dab waley) ikram ( izzat o buzurgi waley ( aisi izzat o martabat waley ke jis izzat ko hasil karney o paney ka koi qasd (irada) o irada hi na kar sakey, aey Allah ! aey badi rehmat waley mein terey jalal aur terey taabnak o munawwar chehrey key wasiley sey tujh sey maangta hun ke to merey dil ko apni kitab ( Quran pak ( key hifz key sath jod dey , jaisey tu ney mujhey Quran sikhaya hai wesay hi mein usey yad o mehfooz rakh sakun , aur to mujhey is baat ki tofiq dey ke main is kitab ko usi tareeqey aur usi dhang sey padhun jo tujhey mujh sey razi o khush kar dey , aey Allah ! aasmano aur zamin key paida karney waley , ( jaah ( o jalal aur buzurgi waley aur aisi izzat waley jis izzat ka koi irada ( tamanna aur khahish ( hi na kar sakey , aey Allah ! aey Rehman terey jalal aur terey chehrey key Noor key wasiley sey tujh sey maangta hun ke to apni kitab key zariey meri nigah ko munawwar kar dey ( mujhey kitabe-Ilahi ki Maarifat hasil ho jaey, aur meri zaban bhi usi key mutabiq chaley , aur usi key zariey merey dil ka gham door kar dey , aur uskey zariey mera Sina khol dey (main har achi o bhali baat ko samajhney lagun) aur uskey zariey merey badan ko dho dey (main pak o saaf rehney lagun ( kyonkey merey haq par chalney key liye terey siwa koi aur meri madad nahin kar sakta , aur na hi koi terey siwa mujhey haq dey sakta hai aur Allah jo bartar aur azeem hai uskey siwa buraiyon sey palatney aur nekiyon ko anjam deney ki tofiq kisi aur sey nahin mil sakti ''. aey abul-Hasan ! aisa hi karo, teen Juma , paanch Juma ya saat Juma tak , Allah key hukm sey dua qubul kar li jaeygi, aur qism hai us zaat ki jisney mujhey haq key sath bheja hai, us ko padh kar koi momin kabhi mehroom na rahega , Abdullah bin Abbas Raziallahu anhuma kehtey hain : qism Allah ki ! Ali (Raziallahu anhu) paanch ya saat Juma thehrey hongey ke wo phir Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki khidmat main eik aisi hi majlis mein hazir huye aur aa kar arz kya : Allah key Rasool ! main is sey pehley chaar aayaten ya un jaisi do eik aayaten kam o besh yad kar paata tha, aur jab unhen dil mein aap hi aap dohrata tha to wo bhool jati thin, aur ab ye haal hai ke main chaalis aayaten seekhta hun ya chaalis sey do chaar kam ya zyada, phir jab main unhen apney aap dohrata hun to mujhey aisa lagta hai jaisey kitabullah meri aakhon key samney khuli hui rakhi hai) aur main rawani sey padhta chala jata hun (aur aisey hi mein is sey pehley hadees suna karta tha, phir jab main usey dohrata to wo dimagh sey nikal jati thi, lekin aaj mera haal ye hai ke main hadisein sunta hun phir jab main unhen bayan karta hun to un mein sey eik harf bhi kam nahin karta , Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney us moqey par irshad farmaya : ''qasam hai rabey-kaaba ki ! aey abul-Hasan tum momin ho ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, hum isey sirf Waleed bin Muslim ki riwayat sey jantey hain."
3806,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' Allah sey uska Fazal maango kyonkey Allah ko ye pasand hai ke us sey manga jaey, aur afzal ibadat ye hai) ke us dua key asar sey) kushadgi (aur khushhaali) ka intizar kya jaey ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hammad bin Waqid ney aisi hi riwayat ki hai, aur unki riwayat mein ikhtilaf kya gaya hai, 2- Hammad bin Waqid ye Saffaar hain, Hafiz nahin hain, aur ye hamarey nazdik eik Basra Shekh hain, 3- Abu-Nueym ney ye hadees Israel sey , Israel ney Hakim bin Juber sey aur Hakim bin Juber ney eik shakhs key wastey sey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey mursalan riwayat ki hai, aur Abu-Nueym ki hadees sehat sey qarib tar hai."
3807,"Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ye dua padhtey they : اللهم إني أعوذ بك من الكسل والعجز والبخل ''aey Allah ! main teri panah chahta hun, susti aur kahili sey, aajizi aur darmandgi sey aur kanjusi o bakheeli sey '' , aur isi sanad sey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey ye bhi aai hai ke aap panah maangtey they budhapey aur azabe-qabr sey . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
3808,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' zamin par koi bhi musalman aisa nahin hai jo gunah aur qata Rehmi ki dua ko chhod kar koi bhi dua karta ho aur Allah usey wo chiz na deta ho, ya uskey badley uskey barabar ki uski koi burai (koi musibat) door na kar deta ho'', is par eik shakhs ney kaha : tab to hum khub ( bahut ( duayen manga kerengey, aap ney farmaya : '' Allah us sey bhi ziyada deney wala hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan sahih gharib hai."
3809,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jab tum apney bistar par soney key liye jaao to jis tarah namaz key liye wuzu kartey ho wesa hi wuzu kar key jaao , phir dahiney karwat leto , phir ( ye ( dua padho : اللهم أسلمت وجهي إليك وفوضت أمري إليك وألجأت ظهري إليك رغبة ورهبة إليك لا ملجأ wala منجا منك إلا إليك آمنت بكتابك الذي أنزلت ونبيك الذي أرسلت ''aey Allah ! main tera tabey farman banda bin kar teri taraf mutawajjeh huwa , apna sab kuch tujhey saunp diya, tujh sey dartey huye aur raghbat kartey huye mainey tera sahara liya , na to meri koi ummid gaah hai aur na hi koi jaey najat , main teri is kitab par eman laya jo tu ney utaari hai aur terey us Nabi par eman laya jisey tu ney bheja hai'' , pas agar to apni us raat mein mar gaya to fitrat ( Islam ( par marega, Bara (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain : mainey dua key un alfaz ko dohraya taake yad ho jaeyn to dohraatey waqt mainey kaha : « آمنت برسولك الذي أرسلت » keh liya to aap ney farmaya : '' ( Rasool na kaho balke ( « آمنت بنبيك الذي"
3810,"hum eik barish wali sakht taareek raat mein Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko talash karney nikley taake aap hamen namaz padha den , chunanche main aapko paa gaya, aap ney farmaya : ''kaho ( padho ( '' , to mainey kuch na kaha : '' kaho '' aap ney phir farmaya , magar mainey kuch na kaha , ( kyonkey malum nahin tha kya kahun ? (aap ney phir farmaya : '' kaho '' , mainey kaha : kya kahun ? aap ney farmaya : « قل هو الله أحد » aur « Muawwizatein » ( « قل أعوذ برب الفلق » , padhi. « قل أعوذ برب الناس » ( subh o Sham teen martaba padh liya karo, ye ( suraten ( tumhen har shar sey bachaeyn gi aur mehfooz rakhengi . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan sahih gharib hai, 2- abu-Saeed Baraad : ye Usaid bin abi Usaid madni hain."
3811,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam hamarey baap key paas aaye , hamney aap key khaney key liye kuch pesh kya to aap ney is mein sey khaya , phir aap key liye kuch khajuren laee gaeen , to aap khajuren khaney aur guthli apni dono ungliyon shahadat aur bech ki ungli sey) dono ko mila kar) phainktey jatey they, Shoba kehtey hain : jo main keh raha hun wo mera guman o khayal hai, Allah ney chaha to sahih hoga, aap dono ungliyon key bich mein guthli rakh kar phenk detey they, phir aap key samney peeney ki koi chiz laee gaee to aap ney pi aur apney daain janib haath waley ko thamaa diya ( jab aap chalney lagey to) aap ki sawari ki lagaam thaamey thaamey merey baap ney aap sey arz kya, aap hamarey liye dua farma dijiye , aap ney farmaya : « اللهم بارك لهم فيما رزقتهم واغفر لهم"
3812,"unhoney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey huye suna : '' jo shakhs kahey : « أستغفر الله العظيم الذي la إله إلا هو الحي القيوم وأتوب إليه » ''main maghfirat maangta hun us buzurg o bartar Allah sey jis key siwa koi mabood bar-haq nahin hai, jo zinda hai aur har chiz ka nigehban hai aur main usi ki taraf ruju karta hun '' , to uski maghfirat kar di jaeygi agar-che wo lashkar ( o fauj ( sey bhag hi kyon na aaya ho . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees gharib hai, hum isey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain."
3813,"eik na-bina shakhs Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas aaya aur kaha : aap dua farma dijiye ki Allah mujhey aafiyat dey , aap ney farmaya : '' agar tum chaho to main dua karun aur agar chaho to sabr kiye raho , kyonkey ye tumharey liye ziyada behtar ( o sood mand ( hai ''. usney kaha : dua hi kar dijiye , to aap ney isey hukm diya ke '' wo wuzu karey , aur achi tarah sey wuzu karey aur ye dua padh kar dua karey :  (اللهم إني أسألك وأتوجه إليك بنبيك محمد نبي الرحمة إني توجهت بك إلى ربي في حاجتي هذه لتقضى لي اللهم فشفعه) '' aey Allah ! main tujh sey maangta hun aur terey Nabi Muhammad jo Nabi rehmat hain key waseeley sey teri taraf mutawajjeh hota hun, mainey aap key wastey sey apni is zarurat mein apney rab ki taraf tawajjoh ki hai taake to aey Allah ! meri ye zarurat puri kar dey to aey Allah to merey barey mein unki shafaat qubul kar padhi. ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih gharib hai aur hum isey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain yani abu Jaafar ki riwayat sey , 2- aur Abu-Jafar khutmi hain 3- aur Usman bin Hanif ye Sehal bin Hanif key bhai hain."
3814,"unhoney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey huye suna : '' rab taala apney bandey sey sab sey ziyada qarib raat key aakhiri nisf hissey key darmiyan mein hota hai, to agar tum un logon mein sey ho sako jo raat key us hissey mein Allah ka zikr kartey hain to tum bhi us zikr mein shamil hokar un logon mein sey ho jaao (yani tahajjud padho) ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan sahih gharib hai."
3815,"mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey huye suna : '' Allah azz-w-jall farmata hai ke mera banda kamil banda wo hai jo mujhey us waqt yad karta hai jab wo jang key waqt apney madde-muqaabil ( dushman ( key samney khada ho raha hota hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, hum isey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain, iski sanad qawi nahin hai, us eik hadees key siwa hum Imaara bin Zaakara ki Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey koi aur riwayat nahin jantey, 2- Allah key qol « وهو ملاق"
3816,"unkey baap ( Saad bin Ubada ( ney unhen Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki khidmat karney key liye aap key hawaley kar diya, wo kehtey hain : main namaz padh kar betha hi tha ke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam merey paas sey guzrey , aap ney apney pair sey) mujhey apni taraf mutawajjeh karney key liye (eik thokar lagai phir farmaya : '' kya main tumhen jannat key darwazon mein sey eik darwaza na bata dun '' , mainey kaha : kyon nahin zarur bataiye , aap ney farmaya : '' wo (لا حول wala قوة إلا"
3817,koi bhi farishta (لا حول wala قوة إلا بالله) kahey baghair zamin sey nahin uthta ( nahin udtaa ( .
3818,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney hum sey farmaya : '' tumharey liye lazim aur zaruri hai ke tasbih padha karo tahleel aur taqdees kya karo padhi. aur ungliyon par) tasbeehaat waghera ko) guna karo, kyonkey un sey) qiyamat mein) puchha jaeyga aur unhen goyai ata kar di jaeygi, aur tum log ghaflat na baratna ke) Allah ki) rehmat ko bhool betho ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey : hum is hadees ko sirf Haani bin Usman ki riwayat sey jantey hain aur Muhammad bin Rabeea ney bhi Haani bin Usman sey riwayat ki hai."
3819,"jab Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam jihad kartey ( ladtey ( to ye dua padhtey : « اللهم أنت عضدي وأنت نصيري وبك أقاتل » '' aey Allah ! to mera bazu hai, tu hi mera madadgar hai aur terey hi saharey mein ladtaa hun ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai 2- aur «"
3820,"Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''sab sey behtar dua Arfa waley din ki dua hai aur mainey ab tak jo kuch ( bator zikr ( kaha hai aur mujh sey pehley jo doosrey nabiyon ney kaha hai un mein sab sey behtar dua ye hai : (لا إله إلا الله وحده لا شريك له له الملك وله الحمد وهو على كل شيء قدير) '' Allah wahid key siwa koi mabood bar-haq nahin hai uska koi shareek nahin, usi key liye (sari kaeynat ki) badshahat hai, usi key liye sari tareefen hain aur wo har chiz par qadir hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey gharib hai, 2- Hammad bin abi Humed ye Muhammad bin abi Humed hain aur un ki kunniyat Abu-Ibrahim Ansari madni hai aur ye muhaddeseen key nazdik ziyada qawi nahin hain."
3821,"hamen Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney sikhaya , aap ney farmaya : '' kaho (اللهم اجعل سريرتي خيرا من علانيتي واجعل علانيتي صالحة اللهم إني أسألك من صالح ما تؤتي الناس من المال والأهل والولد غير الضال wala المضل) '' aey Allah ! mera baatin merey zahir sey achcha kar dey aur merey zahir ko nek kar dey . aur logon ko jo maal to biwi aur bachey ki shakal mein deta hai un mein sey achcha maal dey jo na khud gumrah hon aur na dusron ko gumrah karen ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees gharib hai, hum isey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain aur iski sanad qawi nahin hai."
3822,"mein Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas gaya, aap namaz padha rahey they, aap ney apna baayan haath apni baain raan par rakha tha, aur apna daayan haath apni daain raan par rakha , ungliyan band ki thin ( yani mutthi baandh rakhi thi (aur « سبابہ » ( shahadat ki ungli ( khol rakhi thi aur aap ye dua kar rahey they : (يا مقلب القلوب ثبت قلبي على"
3823,"jab tumhen dard ho to jahan dard aur takleef ho wahan haath rakho phir padho : (بسم الله أعوذ بعزة الله وقدرته من شر ما أجد من وجعي هذا) '' Allah key naam sey Allah ki izzat o qudrat key saharey main apni us takleef key shar sey jo main mehsus kar raha hun panah chahta hun ''. , phir ( dard ki jagah sey) haath hata lo phir aisey hi taaq ( teen ya paanch ya saat ( baar karo, kyonkey Anas bin Malik ney mujh sey bayan kya hai ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney un sey aisa hi bayan kya . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan gharib hai, aur Muhammad bin Salim ye Basra Shekh hain."
3824,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney mujhey ye dua sikhai : (اللهم هذا استقبال ليلك واستدبار نهارك وأصوات دعاتك وحضور صلواتك أسألك أن تغفر لي) '' aey Allah ! ye teri raat key aaney aur terey din key janey ka waqt hai aur tujhey yad karney ki aawaazon aur teri namaz key liye pahunchney ka waqt hai main ( aisey waqt mein) apni maghfirat key liye tujh sey darkhaast karta hun ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai aur hum isey sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain, 2- Hafsa bint abi Kasir ko hum nahin jantey aur na hi hum unkey baap ko jantey hain."
3825,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jab bhi koi banda khuluse dil sey « لا إله إلا الله » kaheyga aur bade gunahon sey bachta rahega to uskey liye aasman key darwazey khol diye jaeyngey, aur ye kalma « لا إله إلا"
3826,"Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ye dua padhtey they : (اللهم إني أعوذ بك من منكرات الأخلاق والأعمال والأهواء) ''aey Allah ! main tujh sey buri aadaton, burey kamon aur buri khuwahishon sey panah maangta hun.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. aur Ziyad bin Ilaaqa key chacha ka naam Qutaba bin Malik hai aur ye Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key Sahaba mein sey hain."
3827,"eik baar hum Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key sath namaz padh rahey they padhi. , usi doran eik shakhs ney kaha : « الله أكبر كبيرا والحمد لله كثيرا وسبحان الله بكرة وأصيلا » ''Allah bahut badai wala hai, aur sari tareefen Allah hi key liye hain, aur paaki hai Allah Taala key liye subah aur shaam.''  Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney (suna to) puchha : ''aisa aisa kis ney kaha hai?'' logon mein sey eik shakhs ney kaha : mainey kaha hai, aey Allah key Rasool ! aap ney farmaya : ''main is kalimey ko sun kar herat mein pad gaya, is kalimey key liye aasman key darwazey kholey gaey.'' ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma kehtey hain : jab sey mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey ye baat suni hai mainey in ka padhna kabhi nahin chhoda hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan sahih gharib hai. 2- Hujjaaj bin Abi Usman ye Hujjaaj bin Maisraa Sawaaf hain, un ki kunniyat Abu-Salt hai aur ye muhaddeseen key nazdik Suqa (bharosemand) hain. faeyda padhi. : ''namaz padh rahey they'' sey murad : hum log namaz shuru kar chukey they, itney mein wo aadmi aaya aur dua sanaa ki jagah usney yehi kalimaat kahey, is par Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney uski taqreer (tasdeeq) kar di, to goya sanaa ki deegar duaaon key sath ye dua bhi eik sanaa hai, Imam Nasaai dua sanaa key baab hi mein is hadees ko latey hain, isliye baaz ulama ka ye kehna ke « سبحانک"
3828,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney un ki iyaadat ki (yahan Raavi ko shubha ho gaya) ya unhoney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki iyaadat ki, to unhoney arz kiya : merey maa baap aap par qurban , aey Allah key Rasool ! kon sa kaliam Allah ko ziyada pasand hai? aap ney farmaya : ''wo kaliam jo Allah ney apney farishton key liye muntakhab farmaya hai (aur wo ye hai) (سبحان ربي وبحمده سبحان ربي"
3829,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''azaan aur iqaamat key darmiyan maangi janey wali dua lotaai nahin jati.''  (yani qubul ho jati hai) logon ney puchha is doran hum kon si dua maangen , aey Allah key Rasool ! aap ney farmaya : ''duniya aur aakhirat (dono) mein aafiyat maango.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan hai, Yahya bin Aban ney is hadees mein is ibarat ka izafa kiya hai ke un logon ney arz kiya ke hum kya kahen? aap ney farmaya : ''duniya aur aakhirat mein aafiyat (yani aman aur sukoon) maango.''"
3830,"Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''azaan aur iqaamat key darmiyan ki dua radd nahin ki jati hai'' (yani zarur qubul hoti hai). Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : Abu-Is'haq Hamdaani ney Bareed bin abi Maryam Koofi sey aur Bareed Koofi ney Anas key wastey sey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey aisey hi riwayat ki hai, aur ye ziyada sahih hai."
3831,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''halkey phulkey log aagey nikal gaey.''  logon ney puchha : Allah key Rasool ! ye halkey phulkey log kon hain? aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Allah ki yad aur zikr mein doobey rehney waley log, zikr unka bojh unkey ooper sey utaar kar rakh dega aur qiyamat key din halkey phulkey ayengey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
3832,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : sari kaaenat sey ke jis par suraj tulu hota hai mujhey ye ziyada pasand hai ke main : (سبحان الله والحمد لله wala إله إلا الله والله أكبر) ''Allah paak hai, tareef Allah key liye hai aur Allah key ilawa aur koi mabood bar-haq nahin aur Allah hi sab sey bada hai''  kahun. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
3833,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''teen log hain jinki dua radd nahin hoti : eik roze daar , jab tak ke roza na khol ley , ( doosrey ( aadil Imam, ( teesrey ( mazloom , uski dua Allah badliyon sey ooper tak pahunchata hai, uskey liye aasman key darwazey khol diye jatey hain, aur Rab kehta hai : meri izzat (qudrat) ki qism ! main teri madad karunga , bhaley kuchh muddat key baad hi kyon na ho.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai. 2- Sa'daan قمی ye Sa'daan bin Bishr hain, in sey Esa bin Yunus , abu-Aasim aur kaee badey muhaddeseen ney riwayat ki hai. aur Au Mujahid sey murad Saad Taai hain. 4- aur Abu Mudilla Ummul-momenin Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) key azad karda ghulam hain hum unhen sirf isi hadees key zariey sey jantey hain aur yehi hadees un sey is hadees sey ziyada mukammal aur lambi riwayat ki gaee hai."
3834,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney ye dua padhi : (اللهم انفعني بما علمتني وعلمني ما ينفعني وزدني علما الحمد لله على كل حال وأعوذ بالله من حال أهل النار) ''aey Allah ! mujhey us ilm sey nafa dey jo tu ney mujhey sikhaya hai aur mujhey wo ilm sikha jo mujhey faeyda dey aur mera ilm ziyada kar , har haal mein Allah hi key liye tareef hai aur main jahannamiyon key haal sey Allah ki panah maangta hun.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan gharib hai."
3835,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''logon key namaae aamal likhney waley farishton key ilawa bhi kuchh farishtey hain jo zamin mein ghoomtey phirtey rehtey hain, jab wo kisi qom ko Allah ka zikr kartey huye paatey hain to eik doosrey ko pukartey hain : aao aao yahan hai tumharey matlab aur maqsad ki baat , to wo log aa jatey hain, aur unhen qaribi aasman tak gher letey hain, Allah un sey poochhtey hai : ''merey bandon ko kya kaam kartey huye chhod aaye ho?'' wo kehtey hain : hum unhen teri tareef kartey huye teri buzurgi bayan kartey huye aur tera zikr kartey huye chhod aaye hain, wo kehta hai : ''kya unhoney mujhey dekha hai (ya bin dekhey huye hi meri ibadat aur zikr kiye ja rahey hain)'' wo jawab detey hain : nahin, Allah kehta hai : ''agar wo log mujhey dekh lein to kya surat aur kaifiyat hogi?'' wo jawab detey hain, wo log agar tujhey dekh lein to wo log aur bhi teri tareef karney lagen, teri buzurgi bayan kerengey aur tera zikr badha dengey, wo poochhtey hai : ''wo log kya chahtey aur maangtey hain?'' farishtey kehtey hain : wo log jannat maangtey hain, Allah poochhtey hai ''kya un logon ney jannat dekhi hai?'' wo jawab detey hain : nahin, wo poochhtey hai : ''agar ye dekh lein to un ki kya kaifiyat hogi?'' wo kehtey hain : un ki talab aur un ki hirs aur bhi ziyada badh jaeygi, wo phir poochhtey hai : ''wo log kis chiz sey panah maangtey hain.''  wo kehtey hain : jahannam sey , wo poochhtey hai : ''kya un logon ney jahannam dekh rakhi hai?'' wo kehtey hain : nahin, wo poochhtey hai : ''agar ye log jahannam ko dekh lein to un ki kya kaifiyat hogi?'' wo kehtey hain : agar ye jahannam dekh lein to us sey bahut ziyada door bhaagengey, ziyada khof khaaeyngey aur bahut ziyada us sey panah maangengey, phir Allah kaheyga ''main tumhen gawah bana kar kehta hun ke mainey un sab ki maghfirat kar di hai.''  wo kehtey hain : un mein falan khatakar shakhs bhi hai, unkey paas majlis mein bethney nahin balke kisi zarurat sey aaya tha, (aur beth gaya tha) Allah farmata hai, ''ye aisey (moazziz aur mukarram) log hain ke unka hum nasheeni bhi mehroom nahin reh sakta (hum ney usey bhi bakhsh diya).'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- ye hadees is sanad key ilawa dusri sanad sey bhi Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey aai hai."
3836,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''(لا حول wala قوة إلا بالله) kasrat sey padha karo, kyonkey ye jannat key khazanon mein sey eik khazana hai.'' Makhool kehtey hain : jisney kaha : (لا حول wala قوة إلا بالله wala منجا من الله إلا إليه) to Allah Taala us sey sattar tarah key zarar aur nuqsan ko door kar deta hai, jin mein kamtar darjey ka nuksan faqr (aur mohtaji) hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : iski sanad muttasil nahin hai, Makhool ney Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey nahin suna hai."
3837,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''har Nabi ki eik dua maqbool hoti hai aur mainey apni dua apni ummat ki shafaat key liye mehfooz kar rakhi hai, us dua ka faeyda Insha'allah ummat key har us shakhs ko hasil hoga jisney marney sey pehley Allah key sath kuchh bhi shirk na kiya hoga.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
3838,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''Allah taala kehta hai : main apney bandey key merey sath guman key mutabiq hota hun padhi. , jab wo mujhey yad karta hai to uskey sath hota hun, agar wo mujhey apney dil mein yad karta hai to main bhi usey ji mein yad karta hun aur agar wo mujhey jamaat ( logon ( mein yad karta hai to main usey us sey behtar jamaat mein yad karta hun (yani farishton mein) agar koi mujh sey qarib honey key liye eik baalisht aagey badhta hai to us sey qarib honey key liye main eik haath aagey badhta hun, aur agar koi meri taraf eik haath aagey badhta hai to main uski taraf do haath badhta hun, agar koi meri taraf chal kar aata hai to main uski taraf daud kar aata hun.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- is hadees ki tafseer mein Aamash sey marvi hai ke Allah ney ye jo farmaya hai ke ''jo shakhs meri taraf eik baalisht badhta hai main uski taraf eik haath badhta hun'' ,is sey murad ye hai ke main apni rehmat aur maghfirat ka maamla uskey sath karta hun. 3- aur isi tarah baaz ehle-ilm ney is hadees ki tafseer ye ki hai ke us sey murad jab banda meri itaat aur merey maamuraat par amal kar key meri qurbat hasil karna chahta hai to main apni rehmat aur maghfirat ley kar uski taraf tezi sey lapakta hun."
3839,"Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : (استعيذوا بالله من عذاب جهنم واستعيذوا بالله من عذاب القبر استعيذوا بالله من فتنة المسيح الدجال واستعيذوا بالله من فتنة المحيا والممات) ''Allah sey panah maango jahannam key azab sey , Allah sey panah maango qabr key azab sey , Allah sey panah maango Masih dajjaal key fitney sey aur Allah sey panah maango zindagi aur maut key fitney sey.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
3840,"Malik bin Abi 'Amir (rz all anh) say rwayt hay:\n\nayk shkhs tlhh bn abydallh (rz all anh) kay pas aaya awr kha: \aay abw mhmd!"""
3841,"Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne mujh se farmaya: \Tum kis qabeele se ho?\"" Maine kaha: \""Daws se.\"" Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \""Maine kabhi yeh nahi socha tha ke Daws mein koi aisa ho jis mein bhalaai ho.\"""""
3842,Abu Hurairah (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay: myn kchh khjwryn lay kr rswl allh (ﷺ) kay pas aaya awr arz kya: ya rswl allh!
3843,"Abdullah bin Rafi' ne riwayat kiya ki: \nMain ne Abu Hurairah (radi Allahu anhu) se pucha: \Aap ko Abu Hurairah kyun kunniyat diya gaya?\"" \nUnhon ne farmaya: \""Kya tum mujh se nahi darte?\"" \n(Abdullah bin Rafi') ne kaha: \""Bilkul"," (main aap se darata hoon).\"""""
3844,"Abu Hurairah [radiyAllahu 'anhu] rivayat karte hain: \RasoolAllah (ﷺ) se zyaada ahaadith ka saath mujh koi nahi hai.\"""""
3845,"Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Abu Umairi (رضي الله عنه) se riwayat hain aur woh Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke Sahaba (رضي الله عنهم) mein se the, Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) se naql farmaya:"
3846,Abu Idris Al-Khawlani (R.A.) ne riwayat ki ke: Jab Umar bin Al-Khattab (R.A.) ne Umair bin Sa'd (R.A.) ko Hims ki hukumat se hata diya.
3847,"Uqbah bin 'Amir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Logon ne Islam liya aur Amr bin Aas (رضي الله عنه) ne iman laye.\"""""
3848,"Talha bin Ubaidullah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke maine Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko farmate suna ke: \Beshak...\"""""
3849,"Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne bayan farmaya: \Hum Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke saath ek jagah par thehre.\"""""
3850,"Al-Bara (رضي الله عنه) se rivayat hai: Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke pareshan par ek resham ki qaba bheji gayi, to log uski narmi par hairaan hone lage."
3851,"Jabir bin Abdullah (رضي الله عنہ) سے روایت ہے:\n\n\میں نے رسول اللہ (ﷺ) سے سنا...\"""""
3852,"Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Razi Allah unho) se riwayat hai ke: \Jab Hazrat Saad bin Mu'adh (Razi Allah unho) ka janaza uthaya gaya...\"""""
3853,"Hamein Ahmad ibn Dawraqi ne riwayat ki, unhone Isma'il ibn Ibrahim se suna, unhone Jurayri se, unhone Abdullah ibn Shaqiq se, unhone kaha: maine Aisha (Allah un se razi ho) se poocha: \Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Sahaba mein sab se zyada mehboob kaun the?\"" Unhon ne farmaya: \""Abu Bakr.\"" Maine poocha: \""Phir kaun?\"" Unhon ne farmaya: \""Phir Umar.\"" Maine poocha: \""Phir kaun?\"" Unhon ne farmaya: \""Phir Abu Ubaydah ibn Jarrah.\"" Maine poocha: \""Phir kaun?\"" Unhon ne khamosh reh kar jawab nahi diya."""
3854,"Jabir bin Abdullah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh: \rswl allh (sly allh alyh wslm) myray pas tshryf layay۔\"""""
3855,"Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Raat-e-Jamal par mere liye maghfirat ki dua ki.\"""""
3856,"Khabbab (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \Hum Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke saath hijrat kiye."""
3857,"Hazrat Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنهم) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Kitne aise hain jinke baal bigde hue hain"""
3858,Abu Musa (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (sly allh alyh wslm) nay frmaya: \naay abw mwsyٰ! tmhyn dawwd (alyh alslam) kay khandan kay mzamyr (srwdِ mlaykh) myn say ayk mzmar (srwd) ata kya gya hay۔
3859,"Sahl bin Sa'd (Razi Allah unho ne) ne riwayat ki:\n\n\Hum Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ke saath the jab Aap (ﷺ) khandaq ka kaam kar rahe the.\"""""
3860,"Anas bin Malik (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) frmatay thay: \aay allh! aakhrt ky zndgy kay swa kwyy zndgy nhyn! ps ansar awr mhajryn kw azt ata frma۔\"""""
3861,Talhah bin Khirash ne riwayat ki: main ne Jabir bin Abdullah (رضي الله عنهما) ko yeh kehte hue suna ke main ne Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) se suna ke Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jis Muslim ne mujhe dekha," usay Aag (Jahannam) chhoo nahi sakti.\"""""
3862,"Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (رضی اللہ عنہ) سے روایت ہے کہ رسول اللہ ﷺ نے فرمایا: \بہترین نسل میری نسل ہے۔\"""""
3863,Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Darakht ke neechay jinhon ne bay'at ki," koi bhi jahannam mein dakhil nahi hoga.\"""""
3864,"Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Mere Sahaba-e-Kiraam (رضي الله عنهم) ki gustaakhi na karo.\"""""
3865,"Abdullah bin Mughaffal (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \allh say drw! allh say drw apnay shabh kay baray myn! mjh kay bad an kw tanay ka nshanh nh bnao۔ jw an say mhbt kray"""
3866,"# Hadith ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\n**Uqbah ibn Mukram al-Basri al-Ammi** (Rizwanullahi Ta'ala Anhu) ne riwayat ki, unhone kaha: **Wahb ibn Jarir ibn Hazim** (Rizwanullahi Ta'ala Anhu) ne humse riwayat ki, unhone kaha: **mere walid** (Rizwanullahi Ta'ala Anhu) ne humse riwayat ki, **Muhammad ibn Abi Ya'qub** (Rizwanullahi Ta'ala Anhu) se, **Abdur Rahman ibn Abi Nu'm** (Rizwanullahi Ta'ala Anhu) se, ke **Iraq ke ek shakhs ne Ibn Umar** (Rizwanullahi Ta'ala Anhuma) se **machhar ke khoon ke bare mein sawal kiya jo libaas par lag jaye**. Is par **Ibn Umar** (Rizwanullahi Ta'ala Anhu) ne farmaya:\n\n*\Is shaksh ko dekho! Woh machhar ke khoon ke bare mein sawal kar raha hai"," jabke unhone Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam ke potey ki qatal kar diya tha.\""*\n\nAur maine **Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam** se suna:\n\n> *\""Beshak"," Hasan aur Husain (Rizwanullahi Ta'ala Anhuma) mere is duniya mein mere do rayhaanay (khushbu daar phool) hain.\""*\n\n**Abu Isa (Tirmizi)** (Rizwanullahi Ta'ala Anhu) ne farmaya: **Yeh ek sahih hadith hai.** Isay **Shu'bah** aur **Mahdi ibn Maymun** ne bhi **Muhammad ibn Abi Ya'qub** (Rizwanullahi Ta'ala Anhu) se riwayat kiya hai. Aur isi tarah ki riwayat **Abu Hurairah** (Rizwanullahi Ta'ala Anhu) se **Nabi Kareem Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam** ki taraf mansoob hai.\n\n---\n\n*Tauzeehiya Note: \""Rayhaanatayya\"" ("""
3867,"Abū Saʿīd al-Ashajj ne hamain bayan farmaya: Abū Khālid al-Aḥmar ne hamain riwāyat ki, unhone kaha: Ruzayn ne hamain riwāyat ki, unhone kaha: Salmā ne mujh se riwāyat ki, unhone kaha:\n\nMain Umm Salamah (Allāh un se raazi ho) ke paas un ke gird aa gaya jab woh roti hui thin. Maine kaha, \Aap ko kya baat ro rahi hai?\"" Unhone kaha"," \""Maine Rasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ko dekha — yani khwaab mein — aur un ke sar aur daadhon par mitti thi.\"" Maine kaha"," \""Aap ko kya hūā"," yā Rasūlallāh?\"" Unhone farmaya: **\""Maine abhi abhi Ḥusayn kī shahādat dekhi hai.\""**\n\nYeh ek *gharīb* (nādir) ḥadīth hai."""
3868,"Abū Saʿīd al-Ashajj ne hamein kaha: ʿUqbah ibn Khālid ne hamein kaha: Yūsuf ibn Ibrāhīm ne mujhe kaha — usne Anas ibn Mālik (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhu) se sunā, woh kehte the:\n\nRasūlullāh (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) se pūchhā gayā: \Aapke ghar ke kaunsa shakhsa aapko ad se ziyada azīz hai?\"" Aon (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) ne farmāyā: \""Al-Ḥasan aur Al-Ḥusayn.\""\n\nAap (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) Fāṭimah (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhā) se bhi kehte: \""Mere dono bete mujhe lāō.\"" Phir aap (ṣallallāhu ʿalayhi wa sallam) unhe soonghte aur unhe gale lagāte.\n\nYeh is isnād se Anas (raḍiyallāhu ʿanhu) ke ḥādīth se *gharīb* (dushwār) ḥādīth hai."""
3869,"Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Agar tum un logon ko dekho jo mere Sahaba ko taanain dete hain...\"""""
3870,"**Hadees ka tarjuma (scholarly Roman Urdu mein):**\n\n**Riwayat: Al-Miswar bin Makhramah (Razi Allah Anhu) ne bayan farmaya:**\n\n**\Aur woh Minbar par takhth par baitha hua tha...\""**\n\n---\n\n**Tafseel aur Sharait:**\n\n* **Hadees ki Ibtedai Jumla:** Yeh Hadees ka aaghaz hai. Iska mukammal matn (text) is jumla ke baad aata hoga.\n* **Riwayat karne wale Sahabi ka naam:** **Al-Miswar bin Makhramah (Razi Allah Anhu)** — yeh Sahaba-e-Rasool (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hain.\n* **Hadees ka mazmoon:** Yeh jumla batata hai ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) **Minbar** (mimbar/jahan Khutba diya jaata hai) par takhth (yaani seedha baithay hue) the. Yeh unki Khutba ya bayan ke dauraan ki haalat hai.\n\n**Islamic Honorifics ka istemal:**\n* **Razi Allah Anhu:** \""Khuda us se raazi ho\"" — Sahabi ke naam ke baad.\n* **Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam:** \""Us par Khuda ki salawat aur salamat ho\"" — Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke naam ke baad.\n\n**Nateeja:** Yeh Hadees ka aaghaz hai. Iska poora matn (text) iske baad aayega"," jismein Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke ahadith ya unke aamal ka zikr hoga."""
3871,"Buraidah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko sab se zyada mahboob aurat Fatimah (رضي الله عنها) thin aur mardon mein Ali (رضي الله عنه) zyada mahboob the.\"""""
3872,**Hadees ka tarjuma (scholarly Roman Urdu mein):**\n\nHazrat Abdullah bin Az-Zubair (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Ali (Razi Allahu Anhu) ne Abu Jahl ki beti ka nikah ka zikra farmaya.
3873,Zaid bin Arqam (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay aly (rzy allh anh) say frmaya:
3874,"Umm Salamah (ra) ne riwayat kiya: \Nabi (ﷺ) ne Al-Hasan (ra) ek libas phela diya.\"""""
3875,"Abdullah ibn Abd al-Rahman ne hamari taraf se riwayat ki, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne humein Isra'il se khabar di, unhon ne Abu Ishaq se riwayat ki, unhon ne Hani' ibn Hani' se, aur unhon ne Ali (radi Allahu anhu) se riwayat ki ke unhon ne farmaya: al-Hasan (radi Allahu anhu) Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se seene ke upar wale hisse mein sab se zyada mushabihat rakhte the, jabke al-Husayn (radi Allahu anhu) Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se us hisse ke neeche wale hisse mein sab se zyada mushabihat rakhte the. Ye ek hasan gharib hadith hai."
3876,Umm Salamah (رضي الله عنها) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Fath-e-Makkah ke din Fatimah (رضي الله
3877,"Jumai' bin 'Umair At-Taimi (رَضِيَ اللَّهُ عَنْهُ) ne rivāyat kī hai:\n\n\Main apne chāchā ke sāhāb 'Āishah (رَضِيَ اللَّهُ عَنْهā) ke pās gaye aur un se pūchhā gayā: 'Rasūlullāh (صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَسَلَّ) ko sab se ziyāda maḥbūb kaun thā?' Unhon ne farmāyā: 'Fāṭimah (رَضِيَ اللَّهُ عَنْهā).' Phir pūchhā gayā: 'Mard mein?' Unhon ne farmāyā: 'Un ke shauhar (عَلِيّ رَضِيَ اللَّهُ عَنْهُ).'\"""""
3878,"Aap Hazrat Aisha Siddiqa (rzy allh anha) say rwayt hay: \myn nby krym (sly allh alyh wslm) ky ksy bywy say atny hasd nh thyty jtny hasd hzrt khdyjh (rzy allh anha) say thyty۔\"""""
3879,"Hazrat Aisha (Razi Allahu Anha) ne farmaya: \n“Main ne kisi aurat se itni hasad nahi ki jitna Hazrat Khadijah (Razi Allahu Anha) se hasad ki – aur Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallem) ne mujh se nikah tab kiya jab woh (Hazrat Khadijah) wafat chukin thin – is ki wajah yeh thi ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallem) ne unhe Jannat mein Qasab (ya’ni moti jaisi saf, chamakdar patthar) se bane ghar ki khushkhabri di thi.”"
3880,"Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \n\as (amt) ky bhtryn awrt khdyjh bnt khwyld (rz all anha) hyn۔\"""""
3881,"Hazrat Anas (Razi Allahu Anho) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Tumhare liye insaan ki maon mein Mariam bint Imran (Alaihas Salaam) ka zikr kafi hai.\"""""
3882,"Hazrat Aisha (rzy allh anha) say rwayt hay: \lwg Hazrat Aisha (rzy allh anha) kay dn apnay thayf pysh krtay thay۔\"" anhwn nay frmaya: \""tw myry sathy hzrt am slmh (rzy allh anha) kay pas jma hwyyn awr khnay lgyn: 'aay am slmh! lwg hzrt aayshh (rzy allh anha) kay dn thfh pysh kr rhay hyn...'\"""""
3883,Hazrat Aisha (Razi Allah Anha) ne riwayat farmaya ke Hazrat Jibril (Alaihis Salaam) ne Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas un ki tasweer ek hareer-e-aabdar (hari reshami kapde) par lekar aaye.
3884,"Hazrat Aisha (Razi Allah Unha) se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Aisha! Ye Jibril hain aur aapko salam kar rahe hain.\"" Unhon ne kaha: \""Maine kaha: 'Aur un par bhi salam aur Allah ki rehmat ho.'\"""""
3885,"Aap Hazrat Aisha (Rizwan Allah Ta'ala Anha) ne riwayat farmaya ke: \Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya ke: 'Yaqeenan Jibril (Alaihis Salaam) tumhare liye Salaam bhejte hain.' Maine kaha: 'Aur us par bhi Salaam ho aur Allah ki Rehmat [aur Uski Barkatein].'\"""""
3886,"Abu Musa (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya: \Kabhi bhi humein - Rasoolullah (صلى الله عليه وسلم) ke Sahaba (رضي الله عنهم) ko - koi hadith wazeh na hoti thi aur hum Aisha (رضي الله عنها) se poochhte the.\"""""
3887,"Musa bin Talhah ne riwayat ki: \Main ne Hazrat Aisha (Razi Allah Anha) se zyada saaf aur wazeh baat karne wala kisi ko nahi dekha."""
3888,Hazrat Amr bin Al-'As (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay anhyn dhat alslsl kay lshkr ka amyr mqrfr frmaya۔ anhwn nay frmaya: myn aap ﷺ kay pas aaya awr arz ky: ya rswl allh! lwgwn myn aap ﷺ kw sb say zyadh kwn azyz hay؟ aap ﷺ nay frmaya: aayshh (rzy allh anha)۔ myn nay arz ky: mrdwn myn؟ aap ﷺ nay frmaya: an kay bap (abwbkr sdyq rzy allh anh)۔
3889,"Hazrat Amr bin Al-As (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh anhwn nay rswl allh (ﷺ) say arz ky: \aap (ﷺ) kay nzdyk lwgwn myn sb say zyadh kwn azyz hay؟\"" aap (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \""aayshh (rz all anha)۔\"" anhwn nay arz ky: \""mrdwn myn؟\"" aap (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \""an kay bap (abwbkr sdyq rz all anh)۔\"""""
3890,"Hazrat Anas bin Malik (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \hzrt aayshh (rzy allh anha) ky fzylt dygr awat pr aysy hay jysay srd ky fzylt dygh khanwn pr hay۔\"""""
3891,Hazrat 'Amr bin Ghalib (raziyallahu 'anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne Hazrat 'Ammar bin Yasir (raziyallahu 'anhu) ke saamne Hazrat 'Aishah (raziyallahu 'anha) ke baare mein buri baat ki. Hazrat 'Ammar (raziyallahu 'anhu) ne farmaya: \Jaa," tujhe nikamma aur raddeeda! Kya tu Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki mahboobah ko gheebat kar raha hai?\"""""
3892,"Ammar bin Yasir (rzy allh anh) ky rwayt hay: \wh as ky bywy dnya awr aakhrt myn bhy hay۔\"" - mrad: aayshh (rzy allh anha)۔"""
3893,"Hazrat Anas (RaziAllahu Anhu) ne riwayat kiya: \Kiya gaya: 'Ya Rasoolallah! Logon mein aap sabse zyada kaun mahbub hai?' Aunhan (SallAllahu Alaihi Wasallam) farmaya: 'Aishah (RaziAllahu Anha).' Kiya gaya: 'Mardon mein?' Aunhan (SallAllahu Alaihi Wasallam) farmaya: 'Ukaar (RaziAllahu Anha) ke pidar (Abu Bakr).'\"""""
3894,"Hazrat Muhammad ibn Bashshar رضي الله عنه rivayat karte hain ke Hazrat Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi رضي الله عنه ne hamen rivayat kiya ke Hazrat Sufyan رضي الله عنه ne Abu Ishaq رضي الله عنه se, aur Abu Ishaq ne Hazrat Hani' ibn Hani' رضي الله عنه se, aur Hazrat Hani' ne Hazrat Ali رضي الله عنه se rivayat kiya ke:\n\nHazrat Ammar رضي الله عنه Nabi ﺷﻴﺮﻭﻥ رضي الله عنه ke dakhil hone ki rahmat talab kar rahe the. Aap"
3895,"Safiyyah bint Huyai (رضي الله عنها) ne riwayat kiya ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) mere paas aaye aur Hafsah aur Aishah (رضي الله عنهما) ki taraf se kuch baatein mujh tak pahunchi thin. Main ne unhe Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) se zikr kiya. Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Tum ne kyun nahi kaha ke 'Aur tum donon mujh se behtar kaise ho?'\"""""
3896,Umm Salamah (رضي الله عنha) ne bayan farmaya ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Fateh Makkah ke saal mein Fatimah (رضي الله عنha) ko bulaya aur un se baat karne ke liye farmaya.
3897,"Hazrat Anas (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki keh: \Hazrat Safiyyah (رضي الله عنها) ko yeh khabar pahunchi keh Hazrat Hafsah (رضي الله عنها) ne farmaya tha: 'Yahoodi ki beti.' Is par Hazron (رضي الله عنها) ne ro diya. Phir Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) unke paas tashreef lae jab woh roti hui thin."""
3898,"Hazrat Aisha (rzy allh anha) rwayt krty hyn kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \tm myn say sb say bhtr wh hay jw apny bywywn kay sath bhtr slwk kray۔\"""""
3899,"Abdullah bin Mas'ud (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \ksy kw myray ksy bhy shabh kay baray myn mjhay kchh nh btana chahyay۔\"""""
3900,"Hazrat Abdullah bin Mas'ud (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \kwyy shkhs mjhay ksy kay baray myn kchh nh btayay۔\"""""
3901,"Ubayy bin Ka'b (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne un se farmaya: \Beshak Allah ne mujhe hukm diya hai ke main tumhe Quran padh kar sunaon.\"" To unhon ne unhe padha: \""Yeh log jinhain kufr kiya tha woh kabhi... (98:1)\"" aur is mein unhon ne padha: \""Beshak Allah ke nazdeik mazhab sirf Hanafiyyah hai...\"""""
3902,"Ubayy bin Ka'b (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Agar Hijrat na hoti...\"""""
3903,"Abū Mūsā al-Ashʿarī (rzy allh anh) nay frmaya: \myn awr myray bhayy ymn say aayay thay، awr hm abdallh bn msawd (rzy allh anh) kw nby krym ﷺ kay ghr walwn myn say nhyn smjhtay thay، as lyay kh wh awr an ky man nby krym ﷺ kay pas bksrt tshryf laya krtay thay\""\n\nabw aysyٰ (trmzy) nay frmaya: \""yh as snd say hsn shyh ghryb hdys hay۔ asay sfyan swry nay bhy abw ashaq say rwayt kya hay۔\"""""
3904,"Hadees ka tarjuma:\n\nHazrat Anas (رضي الله عنہ) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Ansar ki ek jamaat ko ikattha farmaaya aur farmaya: \Aao...\"""""
3905,"Abdullah ibn Abd al-Rahman ne riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Sa'id al-Harrani ne humein khabar di, unhone kaha: Zuhayr ne humein riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Mansur ne humein riwayat ki, Abu Ishaq se, wo al-Harith se, wo Ali رضي الله عنه se, unhone kaha: Rasoolullah ﷺ ne farmaya:\n\n\Agar main kisi ko mashware ke baghair ameer banaata"," to Ibn Umm Abd ko un par ameer banaata.\""\n\nAbu Isa ne kaha: Yeh ek gharib (nadira) Hadith hai. Hum ise sirf al-Harith ki riwayat se Ali رضي الله عنه se jaante hain."""
3906,"Abu Talhah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne mujh se farmaya: \Mere salam apne logon tak pahuncha do.\"""""
3907,"Abu Sa'eed Al-Khudri (rzy allh anh) rwayt krtay hyn kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \bay shk myray khas lwg"""
3908,"Saad (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jo shakhs Quraish ko zaleel karna chahe to Allah usay zaleel kar dega.\"""""
3909,Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se marwi hai: \nNabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne mujh se farmaya: \n\Jis shakhs par Allah aur qayamat ke din ka iman ho," woh Ansar se buz nahi karta.\"""""
3910,"Hazrat Anas bin Malik (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \ansar myray qryby awr myray khas lwg hyn۔ bay shk lwg brhtay jayyn gay awr wh ghttay jayyn gay۔\"""""
3911,"Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Aey Allah! Tu ne Quraish ke awwal logon ko azaab ka maza chakhwa diya.\"""""
3912,"Hazrat Anas (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \aay allh! ansar awr ansar kay bchwn kw maaf frma day۔\"""""
3913,"Hazrat Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنهم) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Kya tumhein bata doon ke Ansar (رضي الله"""
3914,"Abu Usaid Sa'idi (رضي الله عنه) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Ansar (رضي الله عنهم) ke behtareen ghar Banu Najjar (رضي الله عنهم) ke ghar hain.\"""""
3915,"Jabir bin Abdullah (rz all anhma) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \ansar ka bhtryn ghranh bnw njar hay۔\"""""
3916,"Jabir (bin Abdullah) riwayat karte hain ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Ansar-e-Kiraam mein bahut achhe Banu Abdul-Ashhal hain.\"""""
3917,Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat farmaya: \n\Hum Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke saath nikle, yahan tak ke woh Harrah As-Suqya mein pahunch gaye," jo Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (رضي الله عنه) ki thi. Phir Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: 'Mere liye wudu ka paani lao.' Phir Aap (ﷺ) ne wudu farmaya.\"""""
3918,"Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (rzy allh anh) awr hzrt abwhryrh (rzy allh anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \myray ghr awr myry mhrab kay drmyan jw zmyn hay، wh jnt kay baghwn myn say ayk bagh hay۔\"""""
3919,"Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Mere ghar aur mere Minbar ke darmiyan Jannat ke baghon mein se ek bagh hai.\"" Aur isi silsile se."""
3920,Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se marwi hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Jo shakhs Al-Madinah Munawwarah mein marne ki isti'at rakhe," to wahan mar jaye.\"""""
3921,Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) ne bayān farmāyā ki ek āzād karda us kī laṛkī us ke pās āī.
3922,"Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Islam ki aakhri jisey tabah hone wali sheher Madinah Munawwarah hogi.\"""""
3923,Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke ek Arabi aadmi ne Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke huzoor mein Islam ki bay'at li.
3924,Sa'eed bin Al-Musayyab ne riwayat ki ke Abu Hurairah (رَضِيَ ٱللَّٰهُ عَنْهُ) kehte thay ke agar main Madinah Munawwara mein zabbalon ko ghoomta dekhta
3925,"Hadith ka tarjuma:\n\nHazrat Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنہ) se riwayat hai ke (pahad) Uhud Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko nazar aaya, to Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Yeh pahad humse muhabbat rakhta hai aur hum bhi isse muhabbat rakhte hain. Aye Allah! Beshak Ibrahim (علیہ"""
3926,Jarir bin Abdullah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Beshak Allah Ta'ala ne mujhe wahi ki hai ke in teenon jagahon mein se jis jagah bhi tum jaoge," woh tumhari hijrat ki jagah hogi: Al-Madinah...\"""""
3927,"Abu Hurairah (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Koi bhi Madinah ki mushkilat aur taklifon par sabr karne wala nahi hoga.\"""""
3928,"Abdullah bin Adi bin Hamra Az-Zuhri (raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya:\n\n\Mainne Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ko Al-Hazwarah par khade huye dekha.\"""""
3929,"Ibn 'Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne Makkah ke bare mein farmaya: \Tum kitni pyari zameen ho aur tum mujh se kitni aziz ho.\"""""
3930,"Salman (raz) ne riwayat ki: Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne mujhe kaha: \Ai Salman! Mujh se nafrat na karke apna deen na chhod dena.\"" Maine kaha: \""Ya Rasoolallah! Allah ne aap ke zariye hidayat di"," main aap se nafrat kaise kar sakta hoon?\"" Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaaya: \""Tum arab se nafrat karna"," aur isi tarah mujh se nafrat karoge.\"""""
3931,"Hazrat Uthman bin Affan (رضي الله عنہ) se روایت ہے کہ رسول اللہ ﷺ نے فرمایا: \جو شخص عربوں سے دھوکہ دے...\"""""
3932,"Hazrat Muhammad bin Abi Razin ne riwayat kiya ki unki ne kehna: Agar koi Arabi marga ho jaye to Umm Al-Harir par sakht afsos hota. Use puchha gaya ke \Hum dekhte hain ke agar koi Arabi mard marga ho jaye to tum par sakht afsos hota hai.\"" Us ne kaha: \""Maine apne Mawla se suna ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \""Qiyamat ke nishaniyon mein se Arab ki tabahhi bhi hai.\"" Muhammad bin Abi Razin ne kaha: \""Aur uska Mawla Talhah bin Malik tha.\"""""
3933,"Umm Sharik (rzy allh anha) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \lwg djal say bhagyn gay، yhan tk kh wh pharwn ky trf jayyn gay۔\"" am shryk (rzy allh anha) nay arz kya: \""ya rswl allh! as dn arb khan hwn gay؟\"" aap (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \""wh km hwn gay۔\"""""
3934,"Samurah bin Jundab (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \sam (alyh alslam) arb kay bap thay۔\"""""
3935,"Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki: Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke saamne Al-Ajam (Ghair Arab logon) ka zikr kiya gaya, to Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Mujhe un se zyada madad milti hai.\"""""
3936,"Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne bayan farmaya: \Hum Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ke saath baithay thay jab Surah Al-Jumu'ah nazil hui.\"""""
3937,"Zaid bin Thabit [radiyAllahu anhu] ne riwayat kiya ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne Yemen ki taraf dekha aur farmaaya: \Ya Allah! Inke dilon ko hidayat de aur humari sa' aur humari mudd mein barkat ata farma.\"""""
3938,"Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Yahan log tumhare paas aaye hain. Woh dil ke haalat mein kamzor aur samajh mein narm hain.\"""""
3939,"Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Imarat Quraish mein hai.\"""""
3941,"Hazrat Anas (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Azd Allah ke sher hain zameen par.\"""""
3942,Hazrat Anas (Razi Allah unho se) ne riwayat farmaya: \n\Agar hum Al-Azd se nahi hain," toh hum log (bhi) nahi hain.\"""""
3943,"# Hadith ka Tarjuma (Scholarly Roman Urdu)\n\n**Qutaybah ne hamari taraf se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Al-Layth ne hamari taraf se riwayat ki, wo Hishaam ibn Sa'd se, wo Zayd ibn Aslam se, wo Abu Hurairah (RaziAllahu Anhu) se, unhone kaha:**\n\nHum RasoolAllah (SallAllahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke saath ek manzil mein the. Log guzarne lagte, aur RasoolAllah (SallAllahu Alaihi Wasallam) farmate: **\Yeh kaun hai"," Aye Abu Hurairah?\""** Main jawab deta: \""Falan shakhs.\"" Phir Aap (SallAllahu Alaihi Wasallam) farmate: **\""Kitna achha banda-e-Ilahi hai yeh.\""** Phir Aap (SallAllahu Alaihi Wasallam) phir poochhte: **\""Yeh kaun hai?\""** Main jawab deta: \""Falan shakhs.\"" Phir Aap (SallAllahu Alaihi Wasallam) farmate: **\""Kitna bura banda-e-Ilahi hai yeh.\""**\n\nPhir Khalid ibn al-Waleed (RaziAllahu Anhu) guzre"," aur Nabi (SallAllahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: **\""Yeh kaun hai?\""** Maine kaha: \""Yeh Khalid ibn al-Waleed hain.\"" Aap (SallAllahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: **\""Khalid ibn al-Waleed kitna achha banda-e-Ilahi hain — Allah ke talwaron mein se ek talwar.\""**\n\nAbu Isa (Tirmizi", Rahmatullah Alaih) ne farmaya: **Yeh ek *ghareeb* hadith hai. Humein Zayd ibn Aslam se Abu Hurairah (RaziAllahu Anhu) ki taraf se koi seedhi samaa' (direct audition) ka ilm nahi. Meri raay mein yeh ek *mursal* hadith hai. Is bab mein Abu Bakr Siddique (RaziAllahu Anhu) ki bhi ek riwayat hai.**\n\n---\n\n### Istilaahaat ki Tafheemaat:\n\n- **غَرِيب (Gharīb)**: Aisi hadith jiske sanad mein kisi maqam par ek hi raavi ho.\n- **سَمَاع (Samaa')**: Seedhi samaa', ya'ni yeh saboot ke raavi ne hadith us shakhs se suni hai jis se wo riwayat kar raha hai.\n- **مُرْسَل (Mursal)**: Aisi hadith jisme ek Taabi'i (Successor) seedha Sahabi se riwayat karta hai, beech wale raavi ka zikr kiye baghair, is tarah sanad mein qata' (break) paida hota hai.\n- **بِئْسَ عَبْدُ اللَّهِ**: Sakht ninda ka ibaara," jo **نِعْمَ عَبْدُ"""
3944,"Ibn Umar (رضي الله عنهما) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Aslam\"""""
3945,"Jabir (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya ki: \nLogon ne kaha: \Ya Rasool Allah (صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم)! Thaqif qabeela hamare par tirbara raha hai.\"""""
3946,"Imran bin Husain (razi Allahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ki wafat ke waqt teen qabeelon, yani Thaqif, se unhein takleef thi."
3947,"Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Thaqif mein ek jhoota aur ek tabah karne wala hoga.\"""""
3948,Abu Hurairah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh ayk bdwy nay rswl allh (ﷺ) kw ayk jwan awntny hdyh kay twr pr pysh ky۔
3949,Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) se marwi hai ke: Bani Fazarah ka ek shakhs ne Nabi (ﷺ) ko apni un oonton mein se ek oontni hadiya di jo unhon ne Al-Ghabah mein hasil ki thi. Is par Aap (ﷺ) ne us ka badla kuch aur cheez dekar ada farmaya.
3950,"Hazrat 'Amir bin Abi 'Amir Al-Ash'ari (rz all anh) apnay bap say rwayt krtay hyn kh anhwn nay frmaya: rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \qbylh asd awr qbylh asharywn pr brkt hay۔\"""""
3951,"Abdullah ibn Abi Ziyad ne riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Sayyar ne hamain bataya, unhone kaha: Ja'far ibn Sulayman ne hamain riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Thabit aur Ali ibn Zaid ne Anas ibn Malik (radi Allahu anhu) se riwayat ki, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wasallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Kitne hi aise log hain jinke baal bigde hue hain", jinki gardan par dhool jama hui hai, jinke kapde phaile hue hain, jinka koi hisaab nahi rakha jata — magar agar woh Allah ki qasam kha le," to Allah usay poora kar deta hai. Un mein se ek hai Bara' ibn Malik.\""\n\nAbu Eesa (al-Tirmidhi) ne kaha: Yeh is sanad se hasan gharib hadith hai."""
3952,"Abdullah bin Dinar ne riwayat ki, Shu'bah (#3948) ki tarah, aur unhain izafa kiya: \Aur 'Usayyah ne Allah aur Uske Rasool ki nafarmani ki.\"""""
3953,"Abu Hurairah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \as zat ky qsm js kay hath myn mhmd (ﷺ) ky jan hay! ghfar...\"""""
3954,"Imran bin Husain (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh bnw tmym kay ayk grwh nay rswl allh ﷺ ky khdmt myn hazry dy۔ aap ﷺ nay frmaya: \aay bnw tmym! tmhyn khwshkhbry dwn۔\"" anhwn nay arz ky: \""aap nay hmyn khwshkhbry dy hay۔\"""""
3955,"Abu Bakrah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \aslm۔\"""""
3956,"Hazrat Ibn 'Umar (rzy allh anh) rwayt krthyn kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \aay allh! hmary sham myn brkt ata frma۔ aay allh! hmaray ymn myn brkt ata frma۔\"" shabh kram nay arz kya: \""awr hmaray njd myn bhy؟\"" aap (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \""aay allh! hmary sham myn brkt ata frma awr hmaray ymn myn brkt ata frma۔\"" shabh kram nay phr arz kya: \""awr hmaray njd myn bhy؟\"" aap (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \""whan zlzlay hyn۔\"""""
